le multi-stage por microfrontend y docker-compose\n\n- Etapa 1 (node:20-alpine): npm ci, pruebas y build de producción\n- Etapa 2 (nginx:1.27-alpine): solo sirve los estáticos; imagen ligera, sin Node\n- nginx: try_files -> index.html para las rutas de React Router; en los remotos,\n  CORS y remoteEntry.js sin caché\n- HEALTHCHECK en los remotos; el Shell espera con depends_on: service_healthy\n- URLs públicas de los remotos como build args (las descarga el navegador, no el contenedor)\n- docker compose up --build levanta todo en http://localhost:3000\n- .gitattributes con eol=lf para que Dockerfile y nginx.conf no lleguen con CRLF","tree":{"sha":"e7c03b7b0ae88ca4f934b09156950345c31af547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tacho117/rickandmorty/git/trees/e7c03b7b0ae88ca4f934b09156950345c31af547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tacho117/rickandmorty/git/commits/af24959ce58caa3338b13d2d70ca3cf92b44f92c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214563771?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tacho117","id":214563771,"login":"Tacho117","node_id":"U_kgDODMn7uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ta