ta, 404, Suspense y ErrorBoundary\n  que aísla un remoto caído y registra el error en el logger\n- mf-characters (5): tarjeta con todos sus datos, callback onSelect, carga -> tarjetas,\n  error -> reintentar, filtros sin resultados\n- mf-character-detail (2): lee el id de la URL y muestra episodios; 404 sin reintento\n- Remotos falsos vía moduleNameMapper y servicios mockeados: las pruebas no usan red\n- npm test en la raíz corre las 12 pruebas","tree":{"sha":"0d7e0062c94021f26608cda90cf9f55df75f5f5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tacho117/rickandmorty/git/trees/0d7e0062c94021f26608cda90cf9f55df75f5f5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tacho117/rickandmorty/git/commits/73b94ea5dbca5b9493fc7396904d2337657bacfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214563771?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tacho117","id":214563771,"login":"Tacho117","node_id":"U_kgDODMn7uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tacho117","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tacho117/rickandmorty/commit/73b94ea5dbca5b9493fc7396904d2337657bacfc","node_id":"C_kwDOU-9gnNoAKDczYjk0ZWE1ZGJjYTViOTQ5M2ZjNzM5NjkwNGQyMzM3NjU3YmFjZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.c