ork/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/1b35fef5fccc1e17ffa564f47248dcacc026520f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:22:40Z","email":"49168917+vas11yev1work@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anatolii Vasilev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:22:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: add shared claude code config and pr template checklist (#6)\n\n## Description\n\nBrings the shared Claude Code setup and PR template over from\nvc-frontend so agents and PRs follow the same conventions here.\n\n- `CLAUDE.md`: project overview, commands and conventions for Claude\nCode.\n- `.claude/rules/`: project rules (architecture, styles, UI kit, i18n,\nGraphQL, tests, security, etc.).\n- `.claude/hooks/guard-styles.mjs`: `PreToolUse` hook wired in\n`.claude/settings.json` that blocks edits breaking the most-ignored\nstyle rules.\n- `.claude/skills/implement/`: task workflow skill (reuse inventory,\nnaming review, done checks).\n- `.gitignore`: commits only the shared config above; personal skills,\n`*.local.*` settings and runtime state stay ignored.\n- `.github/pull_request_template.md`: adds the fork-customization\nchecklist and a `Breaking changes` section.\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Styles stay customizable for client forks: colours from\npalette/tokens, no !important, no public class or --vc-* token renamed\nor removed (or listed under Breaking changes).\n\n## Breaking changes\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nNone\n### Artifact URL:","tree":{"sha":"c37f9cff24f5fd66ab1b83b5e79f5d111d65caa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/c37f9cff24f5fd66ab1b83b5e79f5d111d65caa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/1b35fef5fccc1e17ffa564f47248dcacc026520f","verification":{"payload":"tree c37f9cff24f5fd66ab1b83b5e79f5d111d65caa3\nparent d3b16d3edf3d4be93b60d42fa4b1509d337b86b2\nparent 4e9ce465758f43efaa424cf408fcf1c3fd407496\nauthor Anatolii Vasilev <49168917+vas11yev1work@users.noreply.github.com> 1791472960 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791472960 +0200\n\nchore: add shared claude code config and pr template checklist (#6)\n\n## Description\n\nBrings the shared Claude Code setup and PR template over from\nvc-frontend so agents and PRs follow the same conventions here.\n\n- `CLAUDE.md`: project overview, commands and conventions for Claude\nCode.\n- `.claude/rules/`: project rules (architecture, styles, UI kit, i18n,\nGraphQL, tests, security, etc.).\n- `.claude/hooks/guard-styles.mjs`: `PreToolUse` hook wired in\n`.claude/settings.json` that blocks edits breaking the most-ignored\nstyle rules.\n- `.claude/skills/implement/`: task workflow skill (reuse inventory,\nnaming review, done checks).\n- `.gitignore`: commits only the shared config above; personal skills,\n`*.local.*` settings and runtime state stay ignored.\n- `.github/pull_request_template.md`: adds the fork-customization\nchecklist and a `Breaking changes` section.\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Styles stay customizable for client forks: colours from\npalette/tokens, no !important, no public class or --vc-* token renamed\nor removed (or listed under Breaking changes).\n\n## Breaking changes\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nNone\n### Artifact URL:","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx7VACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATvAQAAfMBwKtyLOmraol6a6C80C3\nmcbmrdlanAb5h/jLwK4OaNaO9VtDYeJPbHXiXFZke3zNpHD5Pa1J3F6yisEk501C\n0sa2I6dvUVybz22o0e3OQiVVCbb0MLGqIkPwNmEVlPDnL+zNjoz6HlC08MSiiAzL\n5wTCSkYhulmxfLRe5O5b8O1tQSXTZ3s4kmB/K6ZzvEfzulMFeQKohtxBUBKkHlLs\njhLEiPcK39ZorxpeiFnoehI3Zo0Ml8FACgLO8ncN+2ZuucFs