n- Port check (`fork-drift`): nothing to port; `fork-map.json` unchanged.\n\n### Checks\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| validate:types | pass |\n| lint | 30 errors, the same 30 on `origin/dev`; none in files this\nmerge changed |\n| test:unit | 3722 pass |\n| check-locales | pass |\n| build-only | pass |\n\n### Smoke (`vite preview`, backend `vcst-qa.govirto.com`, signed out)\n\nHome, `/catalog`, `/search?q=hat`, a product page, `/cart`, `/sign-in`,\n`/forgot-password`: 26 GraphQL responses without `errors`, no alerts, no\nerror overlay.\n\n## QA checklist\n\nRegression testing: https://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6214\n\n### Backend packages 3.1076.0 — VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend#2547\nWhere: whole storefront, against a backend on the new packages\n- [ ] Signed in → catalog, cart, checkout → no GraphQL errors, no error\ntoasts\n- [ ] Sales-rep dashboard (SalesRep module now a released build) →\norders list and filters load\nNot covered by the smoke: signed-in flows, sales-rep role.\n\n### Password reset — VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend#2547 (removed\n`requestPasswordReset` query)\nWhere: `/forgot-password`\n- [ ] Enter a registered email → submit → success message, reset email\narrives\nNot covered by the smoke: submitting the form (sends mail).\n\n### Version — resolution\nWhere: built app / `package.json`\n- [ ] App version reads 3.0.0, not 2.60.0","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2xICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANzUQALHrB06M+UTeHGtqs9kizOWI\n1tUdQWWCBWh4SwtpfBpqjbO5fY6reRHWjCHN5F79HL9po4cb+DUyitnLfR4t2V8C\nIR8CvWKeZFiVzjsgTRLD35OUv8jG11omvE1I5qRHmTS/yx/+c13SZpixPL8zyFiY\n/iJFpsAVqfvY8aRNOYH8jeCsj+PLUWPUqyMbv99T3o3E7BBUe2Nf203POI0LbYDS\nmxIhmzPzs/WOXOT+GL6MssJnJOYXbmyhYwFFmGApIKmWIfbcSEyeK/GUsbgeR+jS\nOj3XD+094ZDNmf7eoEAR1xFubdR182CLWGvms1FATnmWJumIhh5Q+9OdZXDB7r6B\nCk1bHYs4YyxwF7RvqhRQD+sUWzp7m/GWrqiC0TWQ3DBlIKxkZW3GOCltDk/74Y78\nnCoE7whfG9w+S8Vk26SNglr6KaZKjRFr5eWWf07O+nF9ZQMXmJ66s7BajLEhzUWO\nBuv9di30jBT4GCWCRsBJh6JsbH