https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/7802723af814811dca78b054914ea8ac91460dfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:31:28Z","email":"ivan.kalachikov@gmail.com","name":"Ivan Kalachikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:31:28Z","email":"ivan.kalachikov@gmail.com","name":"Ivan Kalachikov"},"message":"fix: port upstream VCST-5840 to header-preferences-menu\n\nThe desktop language list is the theme''s preferences menu, not\nlanguage-selector.vue, so the merge delivered the decorative-flag fix only\nto the mobile menu. Each option''s flag carried the language''s own name next\nto the same name as text, and a screen reader read it twice.\n\nAdds fork-map.json, recording which upstream files the theme''s components\nreplace so the drift report can triage upstream changes to them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04b80d15c78929fb1297cf8fc3ce74bb1fc530fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/04b80d15c78929fb1297cf8fc3ce74bb1fc530fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/7802723af814811dca78b054914ea8ac91460dfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18286430?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github