lachikov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/7e64d02015707c7f9f98c36de0cbee82959a94d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:11:55Z","email":"ivan.kalachikov@gmail.com","name":"Ivan Kalachikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:11:55Z","email":"ivan.kalachikov@gmail.com","name":"Ivan Kalachikov"},"message":"chore: merge dev into demo/VCST-6030\n\nConflicts and their resolutions:\n\n- shared/catalog/components/category.vue: the theme''s plate layout and its\n  isCompact/isMobile split kept; upstream''s barcode lookup (#2501) ported into\n  it - !isBarcodeLookup on the popup sidebar, facets toggler, controls and\n  horizontal filters, CategorySort standing in for the horizontal bar''s sort,\n  the header_barcode heading in the head plate, hasActiveFilters and the\n  scanned code as the product list''s keyword.\n- loyalty missions-banner / points-balance / missions page: the same redesign\n  on both sides (#2524). Upstream''s API (color prop, --color--info, __action,\n  title outside the slot, balance label as the banner title) with the theme''s\n  plate radius, type sizes, flex-auto body and --vc-icon-color reapplied; the\n  rewards banner keeps its link to the loyalty catalog.\n- ui-kit/organisms/table/vc-table.vue: upstream''s --row-hover-shade and\n  --row-hover-bg-color names (#2532); paprika keeps its own values through\n  --vc-table-row-hover-bg-color (dark stays on neutral-200, where neutral-100\n  is the plate itself).\n- core-api/package.json: 0.2.0, the higher version.\n- sales-rep/PORT_TO_MF.md: both sides'' useBreakpoints call sites.\n\nAlso:\n- core-api contract regenerated: adds the orderDetails extension point the\n  text merge had missed.\n- language-selector.test.ts (upstream): mocks the theme''s useLocaleSwitch\n  instead of useLanguages; assertions unchanged.\n- category.upstream.test.ts, missions-banner.upstream.test.ts: cover the\n  ported lines upstream''s tests did not fail on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"561305d1315462026d8d70b3bb346e08b2a1a0fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/561305d1315462026d8d70b3bb346e08b2a1a0fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/7e64d02015707c7f9f98c36de0cbee82959a94d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18286430?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ivan-kalachikov","id":18286430,"login":"ivan-kalachikov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Mjg2NDMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivan-kalachikov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-ne