t":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/60087b0b973aeac9b26816f8e9133decff2dc760","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDYwMDg3YjBiOTczYWVhYzliMjY4MTZmOGU5MTMzZGVjZmYyZGM3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","sha":"6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb"}],"sha":"60087b0b973aeac9b26816f8e9133decff2dc760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/60087b0b973aeac9b26816f8e9133decff2dc760"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/d8ee5527d68c2bf651072b2eaa4bca699cf1e701/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:49:23Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:49:23Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the pinned header''s captions shrink away instead of being cut\n\nThe labels came off by max-width and max-height alone. Both start far above\nwhat they bound — 8rem and 1rem against labels that measure 25 to 61 wide and\n14 tall — so the widest one saw nothing happen for the first half of the curve\nand was then guillotined from the right over the last 100ms, while the fade,\non its own 0.15s, had already finished. Measured at the halfway frame: the type\nstill at 12px, the line box cut to 8, every caption sliced through the middle\nof its letters.\n\nThe type now rides the same curve: one more additive knob, defaulting to\n`inherit` so the resting size stays the row''s own text-xs and nothing changes\nwhere the plate is not pinned. The leading goes with it as a ratio rather than\nthe pair''s absolute 0.875rem, or the line box stays open at its resting height\nand clips the shrinking glyphs. The two maxima stay as the bound — they still\nguard a translation wider than 8rem and close the item at the end — but with\nthe type shrinking they no longer reach the text: at every point of the curve\nit is 61/128 of the width bound and 14/16 of the height bound. The fade moves\nonto the shared curve too, so all four land together.\n\nMeasured, same halfway frame after: line box 7 against the 8 bound, label 32.1\nagainst 61.2 at rest — exactly half, so the item narrows from the first frame.\nEndpoints unchanged: at rest 12px/14px and 61.2/54.1/27.7/40.5/34.8/25.3 wide,\nbyte for byte what they were; pinned, 0 on every one, the row 88 to 64 and the\nlinks 387.6 to 284.","tree":{"sha":"789f30589c808118b3a0b34cbad0aefa36d8f658","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/789f30589c808118b3a0b34cbad0aefa36d8f658"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/d8ee5527d68c2bf651072b2eaa4bca699cf1e701","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/d8ee5527d68c2bf651072b2eaa4bca699cf1e701","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKGQ4ZWU1NTI3ZDY4YzJiZjY1MTA3MmIyZWFhNGJjYTY5OWNmMWU3MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","sha":"6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb"}],"sha":"d8ee5527d68c2bf651072b2eaa4bca699cf1e701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/d8ee5527d68c2bf651072b2eaa4bca699cf1e701"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49168917?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vas11yev1work","id":49168917,"login":"vas11yev1work","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTY4OTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:02:08Z","email":"anatolii.vslvv@gmail.com","name":"Anatolii Vasilev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:02:08Z","email":"anatolii.vslvv@gmail.com","name":"Anatolii Vasilev"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): paprika dark theme v2 — surfaces, shadows and edges\n\n- Solid buttons lighten on hover by one rule (white 24%) via --vc-button-solid-hover-mix.\n- Product photo slots sit on white (--vc-product-image-bg); the card''s brightness filter is gone.\n- Header, home plates and footer are the glass plate (neutral-100 @ 72%) with a warm rim and\n  black shadows; neutral-50 shadows were the canvas colour and vanished.\n- Home: suppliers plate, hero notches, Consumer Electronics / Home supplies tiles and product\n  cards follow the design''s dark surfaces.\n- Header menus share one surface, outline, group line and a black shadow.\n- Popover, dialog, tab switch and wishlist card shadows are black in dark: shadow-* is drawn in\n  additional-950, the light end in every dark preset. Modal scrim dims instead of lighting up.\n- Account rail groups take the widget surface; widget dividers step up to neutral-300.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c48ac027fbbe0711d2130e1015d7740d925ea74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/4c48ac027fbbe0711d2130e1015d7740d925ea74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49168917?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vas11yev1work","id":49168917,"login":"vas11yev1work","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTY4OTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDZlYTE3NGY5NjU0ODFjYmYyNjAyYjExOGU4MTE0OWMxMzJkNWJkZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46","sha":"bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46"}],"sha":"6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/6ea174f965481cbf2602b118e81149c132d5bddb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:08:56Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:08:56Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the self-review batch, and the account rail as the facet card (006)\n\nTwo blockers the review caught in the hour of work before it, five should-fixes\neach raised by one of the four passes, and design-review item 006.\n\nBLOCKER — `overflow: clip` on the widget''s last box clipped every popover panel\nopened inside a widget body. VcPopover does not teleport by default\n(`enableTeleport` resolves to false) and `.vc-popover` is `position: relative`, so\na panel''s containing block sits inside the clipped box: measured on the cart, a\nprobe hanging 80px past the bottom edge was clipped away and `elementFromPoint`\nthere returned another element. Every select, dropdown, tooltip and date picker\nin a widget body would have lost whatever opened past the plate. The clip is\ngone; the flush body rounds its own corner through `--vc-table-flush-radius`, and\nthe corner cells of the last row measure 28 on the quotes table. The same probe\nafter the change is not clipped.\n\nBLOCKER — `color_additional_950` had gone to #000000 on the design''s reasoning,\nwhich is about shadows and does not hold here: `_paprika.scss` already re-bases\nthe plate shadow on the NEUTRAL ramp for exactly this reason, while the token\nitself is ink in the dark layer (vc-alert, vc-chip, vc-badge and vc-button all\nfall back to it) and paprika would have been the only one of eight dark presets\nwith it at the dark end. Back to #f6efe6.\n\nAnd the row hover was invisible in paprika dark — neutral-100 is byte-identical\nto the plate (#29201b, distance 0.0). Dark goes back up to 200, 12 off the plate.\n\nFour more, each verified before acting: vc-widget-skeleton still spent the\nwidget''s OLD 16/20 vertical inset, so the placeholder was shorter than the\ncontent replacing it; vc-table.stories.ts taught the hardcoded hover on 11 rows;\n`$wide: 1900px` in vc-typography was a bare pixel breakpoint whose justification\nthe 4xl step added on this branch had made false, so it snaps to\n`theme(\"screens.4xl\")` — the built CSS carries `@media(width>=1920px)` and no\n1900px anywhere; credit-card-skeleton kept `rounded` while the card it stands in\nfor moved to the theme''s radius.\n\nThe Back-in-Stock white square was NOT the widget: that page''s own block paints a\nflat `bg-additional-50` on the same rectangle as the rounded, bordered container\ninside it, so four square corners showed past the curve. Same radius now.\n\n006 — the account rail''s groups were a third kind of surface beside the category\npage''s facet cards. \"Один компонент виджета для обоих мест\" is the item''s own\nwording, so VcWidget gains the four knobs the construction needs, each defaulting\nto the value it already had: `--vc-widget-header-min-height`,\n`--vc-widget-header-padding-y` (takes a PAIR — 20 above the title, 6 below),\n`--vc-widget-header-padding-x` and `--vc-widget-title-font-size`. Measured against\nthe facet rail side by side: radius 16/16, surface rgb(21,15,12) both, gap 20/20,\ntitle 18px weight 600 both, heading-to-rule 6/6, label inset 21 against 20. The\nfacet rail drops its hardcoded `font-bold` in the same breath — the display face\nwent to 600 across the theme and that one rule left the catalog sidebar heavier\nthan every other heading on the page.\n\nStill off the design: the rail''s row is 40 tall against its 36. VcMenuItem bakes\nthe vertical padding into its size modifier and exposes no knob for it.\n\nGates: validate:types clean, build green, test:unit 208 files / 3371 tests,\neslint 0 errors on the changed files (11 warnings, the same 11 the base has),\nvalidate:dependencies 21 warnings / 0 errors as at base, SonarCloud PR 2494 clean.","tree":{"sha":"cd8d3f447508d3a9f64e7cf51dade79862e3b2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/cd8d3f447508d3a9f64e7cf51dade79862e3b2c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKGJkNmRjYmEwZWQ1ODI3MTQ2YzVlMmUzNjJkZTY3NmFlMGEzZmJiNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/63e124387de2181f65c98c6c47f04f23fe044f14","sha":"63e124387de2181f65c98c6c47f04f23fe044f14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/63e124387de2181f65c98c6c47f04f23fe044f14"}],"sha":"bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/bd6dcba0ed5827146c5e2e362de676ae0a3fbb46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/63e124387de2181f65c98c6c47f04f23fe044f14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T07:23:03Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T07:23:03Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the saved credit card matches the design''s tile\n\nThree things stood apart from the drawing, measured side by side against\nlocalhost:8099/ui_kits/storefront/#cards:\n\n- the corner was `rounded`, a flat 4px whatever the theme says, against the\n  design''s 12 — the theme''s own surface radius, which every panel beside it takes;\n- the remove control was sent to the end of the row with `order-last` and sat hard\n  against the card''s edge; the design puts it before the expiry, and it is the\n  expiry that carries its 32 to the edge. The glyph goes with it: `delete-thin` is\n  the kit''s dismiss cross, and a destructive control is `trash-2` here, as on a\n  line item;\n- the list stepped its gap down to 10 above md; the design holds 12.\n\nCard height 64, radius 12, gap 12 — the design''s numbers exactly.","tree":{"sha":"9d6f47735c678b696d84b1893acb6575710d74ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/9d6f47735c678b696d84b1893acb6575710d74ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/63e124387de2181f65c98c6c47f04f23fe044f14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/63e124387de2181f65c98c6c47f04f23fe044f14","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDYzZTEyNDM4N2RlMjE4MWY2NWM5OGM2YzQ3ZjA0ZjIzZmUwNDRmMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/a056ead7544f8ad57349f8758e0de71c81bec292","sha":"a056ead7544f