epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/66d4c91cf52f4913169d4fe18a868564f96d3be6","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDY2ZDRjOTFjZjUyZjQ5MTMxNjlkNGZlMThhODY4NTY0Zjk2ZDNiZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de","sha":"bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf","sha":"7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf"}],"sha":"66d4c91cf52f4913169d4fe18a868564f96d3be6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/66d4c91cf52f4913169d4fe18a868564f96d3be6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49168917?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vas11yev1work","id":49168917,"login":"vas11yev1work","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTY4OTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:14:25Z","email":"49168917+vas11yev1work@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anatolii Vasilev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:14:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VCST-6048): demo home in the dark theme (#2512)\n\n## Description\n\nA follow-up to #2508: the demo main page in the dark theme, following\nthe Claude Design storefront kit. The paprika dark preset flips the\ncolour ramps, so surfaces that should look the same in both themes had\nturned inside out.\n\n**Ink plates** (shop by supplier, the quote in *What it changes*) stay\ndark with light text. Inside them `--color-additional-50` is re-pointed\nto `neutral-950`, so the existing `additional-50/xx` utilities follow\nwithout per-element rules. The supplier plate uses `neutral-100` instead\nof the design''s `neutral-50 / 82%`: that one is the page background\nitself, and without the design''s glass sheen the plate disappears.\n\n**Brand surfaces** take the design''s dark roles:\n- *Why buy* cards: brand `primary-300` / `primary-950`, taupe\n`secondary-400` / `secondary-950`, sand stays light (`neutral-950`) with\ndark ink.\n- *CTA* plate is `primary-300`, and its buttons take their colours on\nthe button itself. The kit''s dark rules (`html.dark\n.vc-button--solid--primary`, same for outline) set them there and were\noverriding the section''s variables. The white button''s shadow is dark in\ndark: the design''s `additional-950` turns light there and glows.\n\n**Smaller bits**\n- Red eyebrows are `primary-600` in dark (hero, categories, popular, why\nbuy, what it changes).\n- Brand logos sit on light plates (`secondary-950`) in dark, as in the\ndesign: ink logos don''t read on a dark plate.\n- Supplier logo plates and the sand stat use the design''s dark steps.\n- The hero title is a fixed 50px from `lg` up, the top of the design''s\nrange.\n\nLight theme is unchanged except the hero title size and the CTA solid\nbutton''s new shadow.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6048\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2c349ea7cb785872797dfe8dec994d30f3cb75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/d2c349ea7cb785872797dfe8dec994d30f3cb75b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf","verification":{"payload":"tree d2c349ea7cb785872797dfe8dec994d30f3cb75b\nparent 217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d\nauthor Anatolii Vasilev <49168917+vas11yev1work@users.noreply.github.com> 1790280865 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790280865 +0200\n\nfeat(VCST-6048): demo home in the dark theme (#2512)\n\n## Description\n\nA follow-up to #2508: the demo main page in the dark theme, following\nthe Claude Design storefront kit. The paprika dark preset flips the\ncolour ramps, so surfaces that should look the same in both themes had\nturned inside out.\n\n**Ink plates** (shop by supplier, the quote in *What it changes*) stay\ndark with light text. Inside them `--color-additional-50` is re-pointed\nto `neutral-950`, so the existing `additional-50/xx` utilities follow\nwithout per-element rules. The supplier plate uses `neutral-100` instead\nof the design''s `neutral-50 / 82%`: that one is the page background\nitself, and without the design''s glass sheen the plate disappears.\n\n**Brand surfaces** take the design''s dark roles:\n- *Why buy* cards: brand `primary-300` / `primary-950`, taupe\n`secondary-400` / `secondary-950`, sand stays light (`neutral-950`) with\ndark ink.\n- *CTA* plate is `primary-300`, and its buttons take their colours on\nthe button itself. The kit''s dark rules (`html.dark\n.vc-button--solid--primary`, same for outline) set them there and were\noverriding the section''s variables. The white button''s shadow is dark in\ndark: the design''s `additional-950` turns light there and glows.\n\n**Smaller bits**\n- Red eyebrows are `primary-600` in dark (hero, categories, popular, why\nbuy, what it changes).\n- Brand logos sit on light plates (`secondary-950`) in dark, as in the\ndesign: ink logos don''t read on a dark plate.\n- Supplier logo plates and the sand stat use the design''s dark steps.\n- The hero title is a fixed 50px from `lg` up, the top of the design''s\nrange.\n\nLight theme is unchanged except the hero title size and the CTA solid\nbutton''s new shadow.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6048\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtYShCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAD6IQAEFXGAB66PTzTbP7KhhxnuOE\nfItkPwxx7f1HWetWT33R+nqBp4xMOgeQ5eJid7HTu+qdexXc1zTQWqBXOGn5yZ5Z\nP9GYh8HQD2rBeFgPq9DChVUp9qU8bUD7ebA/7EYYUP8SCToH+cmnTxef6Ypoq+iI\n7Ml0Gtov6qwrFFliyhMIwrSz9BwKePiiD6hrsMpgx/aKv+J7KnE/TsW/LSduZXog\nrRyP5TA2JFJB4H2/w5CCR99spf8hRqfdWPspw+j5KNqE55qPhAxWaIFU/ERrbS09\nvpU3NDenNHhG4w5RSxbXdBY4iYC7qFEnnoQzn+WO9+MDOp0ldlakpWpF8H8PbUY4\nVNb67i+91crQ1EbTU/I4CAQqPC6wB9a5jiNQBqZRkjPM1HpVPdx7fl/u5WjyWfzF\nx9FnjHmIsqIGC7oNURtnEfutk5z6D93VqhKPMm71kcNs/yyt3+MZZH8V8Xo3h1g8\nEm7kMTBrGSDCWFaOl/qzwSWn9ilcHAqldo00bbaPeyn82kZ7boB37bNc+QmKSM01\nsIpB4R22xVQNXI4CRe/xAkXdKhmRRHU9zWhE0fo5lGoAmhw4HZ/rgutYgqlb5XSi\noMZdInr2DeGNAjC6FlayFJwa5AblRzBnrM2fuaSgBaZKyMLPGc92Aagt+XnZ47gI\n5rXZYvEGKCzDbsa54Fn9\n=4VHb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:39:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDc3NDE5NzljOTc0YzAxYjVmZjM2MGI3MGNiMTkxNzZkZDkyZTNmYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d","sha":"217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d"}],"sha":"7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/7741979c974c01b5ff360b70cb19176dd92e3fbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56412054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Lenajava1","id":56412054,"login":"Lenajava1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDEyMDU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenajava1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/48a9759c03a3aca07f8f8b851095891fb0c88ce9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T14:53:12Z","email":"56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Elena Mutykova"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T14:53:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(VCST-6083): offer Download for non-inline documents in the Sales Rep document library widget (#2509)\n\n## Summary\nThe Sales Rep hub **Document library** widget rendered an action only\nfor inline-renderable documents (PDF, images, plain text), so Word /\nExcel / ZIP rows showed a title and meta line with no control at all.\nThis adds a **Download** action for those rows, matching\n`/company/documents`. Fixes JIRA **VCST-6083**.\n\n## Root cause\n`sales-rep-documents.vue` rendered its only action as `<VcButton\nv-if=\"isInlineRenderable(document.contentType)\">` with no `v-else`. The\ninline-render restriction itself is correct (other types could run\nscript on the storefront origin), but gating the *whole* action on it\nleft non-inline rows with nothing.\n\n## Fix\n- `client-app/modules/sales-rep/components/sales-rep-documents.vue`: add\na `v-else` **Download** button (`downloadFile(document.url,\ndocument.name)` from `@/shared/files`, the same call\n`pages/documents.vue` uses). Open stays gated on `isInlineRenderable`,\nso inline rows are unchanged and every row has exactly one action.\n- Label reuses the existing `sales_rep.documents.details.download` key\n(already translated in all 13 locales), so no locale files change.\n- Button styling matches the Open action (`xs`, `secondary`, `outline`)\nwith the page''s `download` icon.\n\n## Test (red → green)\n- Added to\n`client-app/modules/sales-rep/components/sales-rep-documents.test.ts`\n(vitest, mounted component / rendered DOM):\n  - DOCX, XLSX and ZIP rows each render a Download `<button>`;\n- clicking it calls `downloadFile(url, name)` and not\n`openAuthorizedFile`;\n  - a PDF row keeps a single Open action and no Download;\n  - a mixed list gives every row exactly one action.\n- 5 of the new tests fail on `dev` without the fix and pass with it.\nExisting tests are unmodified, including \"hides Open for a type that\ncannot be viewed in a tab\", which still holds.\n\n## Verification\n- [x] vue-tsc --noEmit (`tsconfig.app.json`, `tsconfig.vitest.json`):\npass\n- [x] eslint on the changed files: pass\n- [x] vitest, whole `client-app/modules/sales-rep/` folder: 58 files /\n664 tests pass\n- [ ] build: not run locally (template change plus one import); left to\nCI\n- [ ] SonarCloud quality gate: pending CI\n\n## ⚠ Needs visual / E2E verification\nLogic is unit-proven. The widget row layout with the new button, and the\nactual file download, still need confirming on a real deploy via\n`/qa-verify-fix VCST-6083`.\n\n<img width=\"428\" height=\"661\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6efad68d-a515-4a82-85e1-f2297c265051\"\n/>\n\n\n## Reviewer notes\n- Kept to one action per row (Download only where Open is unavailable)\nrather than adding Download to every row as the full page does, to leave\nthe compact widget layout of existing PDF rows unchanged. Easy to switch\nto an unconditional Download if the team prefers parity with the page.\n- DO NOT MERGE until human review.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nArtifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2509-ce83-ce8324b7.zip\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cd5b6fc24769f5b3744b560c27447c06b2fcc28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/8cd5b6fc24769f5b3744b560c27447c06b2fcc28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/48a9759c03a3aca07f8f8b851095891fb0c88ce9","verification":{"payload":"tree 8cd5b6fc24769f5b3744b560c27447c06b2fcc28\nparent 333beb76eacfdf5cb9346ee757660f438e31ac00\nauthor Elena Mutykova <56412054+Lenajava1@users.noreply.github.com> 1790261592 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790261592 -0600\n\nfix(VCST-6083): offer Download for non-inline documents in the Sales Rep document library widget (#2509)\n\n## Summary\nThe Sales Rep hub **Document library** widget rendered an action only\nfor inline-renderable documents (PDF, images, plain text), so Word /\nExcel / ZIP rows showed a title and meta line with no control at all.\nThis adds a **Download** action for those rows, matching\n`/company/documents`. Fixes JIRA **VCST-6083**.\n\n## Root cause\n`sales-rep-documents.vue` rendered its only action as `<VcButton\nv-if=\"isInlineRenderable(document.contentType)\">` with no `v-else`. The\ninline-render restriction itself is correct (other types could run\nscript on the storefront origin), but gating the *whole* action on it\nleft non-inline rows with nothing.\n\n## Fix\n- `client-app/modules/sales-rep/components/sales-rep-documents.vue`: add\na `v-else` **Download** button (`downloadFile(document.url,\ndocument.name)` from `@/shared/files`, the same call\n`pages/documents.vue` uses). Open stays gated on `isInlineRenderable`,\nso inline rows are unchanged and every row has exactly one action.\n- Label reuses the existing `sales_rep.documents.details.download` key\n(already translated in all 13 locales), so no locale files change.\n- Button styling matches the Open action (`xs`, `secondary`, `outline`)\nwith the page''s `download` icon.\n\n## Test (red → green)\n- Added to\n`client-app/modules/sales-rep/components/sales-rep-documents.test.ts`\n(vitest, mounted component / rendered DOM):\n  - DOCX, XLSX and ZIP rows each render a Download `<button>`;\n- clicking it calls `downloadFile(url, name)` and not\n`openAuthorizedFile`;\n  - a PDF row keeps a single Open action and no Download;\n  - a mixed list gives every row exactly one action.\n- 5 of the new tests fail on `dev` without the fix and pass with it.\nExisting tests are unmodified, including \"hides Open for a type that\ncannot be viewed in a tab\", which still holds.\n\n## Verification\n- [x] vue-tsc --noEmit (`tsconfig.app.json`, `tsconfig.vitest.json`):\npass\n- [x] eslint on the changed files: pass\n- [x] vitest, whole `client-app/modules/sales-rep/` folder: 58 files /\n664 tests pass\n- [ ] build: not run locally (template change plus one import); left to\nCI\n- [ ] SonarCloud quality gate: pending CI\n\n## ⚠ Needs visual / E2E verification\nLogic is unit-proven. The widget row layout with the new button, and the\nactual file download, still need confirming on a real deploy via\n`/qa-verify-fix VCST-6083`.\n\n<img width=\"428\" height=\"661\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6efad68d-a515-4a82-85e1-f2297c265051\"\n/>\n\n\n## Reviewer notes\n- Kept to one action per row (Download only where Open is unavailable)\nrather than adding Download to every row as the full page does, to leave\nthe compact widget layout of existing PDF rows unchanged. Easy to switch\nto an unconditional Download if the team prefers parity with the page.\n- DO NOT MERGE until human review.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nArtifact URL:\n\nhttps://vc3prerelease.blob.core.windows.net/packages/vc-theme-b2b-vue-2.59.0-pr-2509-ce83-ce8324b7.zip\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtTlYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzDcQADqLLroT+8hTTxhj8c9/u8sq\nr9OVGVzazXt8O/6waCpef/FuMG3UO0Prlvopt5MB3ao91YMp+UlIzG6rIkaYjxQj\nLYeY7AEaJgftrlm10dPQAQJw8d+m7YmVUcEqyvhokDOS+5PMLNCNQ6DwWcFm0vdE\nz4nn5ZRjG0BvMb35jHGjqYpIRkCJAr8DcoyCTMe2JvS6tzKO8JZaBcEcJ0b6IyuO\nNp+OL2k7G1OxwTabS0o96A3AIF09wXe3d6B2QwKocLJGG+CMKGlOcRQzW3zgtWoD\nKbo7gSUWx46PaAcGh7XAHGGEJXOISESL5aYnZ3eaXUmre0tc1hqLfrRdgE4+dOyL\nx0YV/O5WQ0jFS/tWVhSr9yroRhDhHpVw4hA5SRAzX+IwdG127ZRuG5d/yuI/rhFf\nffTKX5SmwEv8I+PElk28OrLZevjhoHeC1c+Lo6RVsmoYbRQVeuyuO0YATAxKDtNq\nAu/7whoQvrLBQRd4LJ7fkqt1n1ZQA7wqH1N42z+DReYez+syJZ/b8QDqoHkmdKm5\nmXrtiAeTxNCLJg7DuEvydTWutnlYXTy3f2HBy78dnZ+jOhnE5XcW0w1u1uM4aC8h\ns8+XePvyuUxwO/20gnbNgRL2PltFXke77pkn6l8jYvcLOurN/S/0cHf0jt/CeWkt\nEHf6FF2FMAN3NPVSEQsS\n=0EmW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:39:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/48a9759c03a3aca07f8f8b851095891fb0c88ce9","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDQ4YTk3NTljMDNhM2FjYTA3ZjhmOGI4NTEwOTU4OTFmYjBjODhjZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/333beb76eacfdf5cb9346ee757660f438e31ac00","sha":"333beb76eacfdf5cb9346ee757660f438e31ac00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/333beb76eacfdf5cb9346ee757660f438e31ac00"}],"sha":"48a9759c03a3aca07f8f8b851095891fb0c88ce9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/48a9759c03a3aca07f8f8b851095891fb0c88ce9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:02:21Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:02:21Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the pager''s ring has to survive the inverted ramp\n\nThe ring I gave the page number carries `neutral-200`, and dark flips the\nneutral ramp: measured #2b2621 on a #241c15 plate, 1.12:1. The hairline the\ndesign added so an unselected page reads as a round control vanished in the\none theme where the row needs it most.\n\nDark takes `neutral-400` instead — 2.43:1 in paprika, 3.88 in red, 3.80 in\ncoffee. It restores the intent rather than the number, and stays a hairline.\n\nThe hover ring had the same fault the other way: light brightens toward\n`primary-200`, which inverted is a muddy brown (#793826 in paprika), so the\nring went dull on hover. Dark brightens to the brand step.\n\nThe active page''s fill is NOT changed, and the pale tint is deliberate.\nMeasured with the near-black ink on `primary-500`: red 4.37, coffee 4.29 —\nboth under AA, which is why the shared dark rule lightens it. Paprika would\npass at 5.91 and is the only preset that could wear the brand orange, but\n_paprika.scss loads whatever preset is active, so pinning it there would\ntake red and coffee below AA.","tree":{"sha":"324540df2d14a61ab0d575d9414921cd40be6ddd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/324540df2d14a61ab0d575d9414921cd40be6ddd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKGJkN2ZjM2YzYzlkYjEwMDRiNjkzYTk0MzQzOGFjYjkzY2JiYTMxZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d","sha":"217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d"}],"sha":"bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/bd7fc3f3c9db1004b693a943438acb93cbba31de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:49:24Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:49:24Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the page number is a control, so it takes the control radius\n\nA pager is a row of controls. Its arrows are VcButtons and were rounded\nwith everything else — measured 9997px on the live page — while the page\nnumber carried a hardcoded `rounded`, 4px, so one row held two different\narcs. Nothing in the app overrode it: the number''s radius was written into\nthe kit rather than read from a token, which is why the theme''s rounding\npassed it by.\n\nThe number now takes a full radius through `--vc-pagination-page-radius`.\n`min-width` equals the height, so one and two digits draw a true circle and\na long page stretches to a pill rather than a box.\n\nIt also gains the ring the design gives it: on a white plate an unselected\npage read as a bare digit and the row did not look like round controls at\nall. The ring is `--vc-pagination-page-border-color`, brightening to\nprimary on hover, and the active page rings itself in its own fill — which\nis the same token dark already retunes, so dark follows without a second\nrule. The ellipsis keeps none.","tree":{"sha":"1a2703932842a4de10aef7b0dafbad9ea4155c63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/1a2703932842a4de10aef7b0dafbad9ea4155c63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/217906b1650b5a181b4213237d78628a03e6d84d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.co