ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/9203e05acc933f49b1fa10722e9ea8e0ddd69050/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:41:09Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:41:09Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the widget''s head mark must not be flow content\n\nVcShape draws a div, and a collapsible widget draws its header as a button\n— so `icon-shape` on one would have put flow content inside a button. No\ncall site pairs them today, but the prop made the path reachable, and the\nbare `prepend-icon` it replaces rendered a span.\n\nVcShape takes an optional `tag`, defaulting to the div it always drew, and\nthe widget header asks for a span. Measured: the head mark is now a SPAN at\n36x36, and product-titled-block''s shape is still a DIV.","tree":{"sha":"da8d8b67f4658689f175381aece4d99d99dd40f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/da8d8b67f4658689f175381aece4d99d99dd40f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/9203e05acc933f49b1fa10722e9ea8e0ddd69050","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/9203e05acc933f49b1fa10722e9ea8e0ddd69050","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDkyMDNlMDVhY2M5MzNmNDliMWZhMTA3MjJlOWVhOGUwZGRkNjkwNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/0b79ecae5dcd771ae4cb63492f77acb987ea46a3","sha":"0b79ecae5dcd771ae4cb63492f77acb987ea46a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/0b79ecae5dcd771ae4cb63492f77acb987ea46a3"}],"sha":"9203e05acc933f49b1fa10722e9ea8e0ddd69050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/9203e05acc933f49b1fa10722e9ea8e0ddd69050"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/0b79ecae5dcd771ae4cb63492f77acb987ea46a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:35:53Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:35:53Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): every headed block on the product page wears the same mark\n\nThe page drew its block heads two ways. ProductTitledBlock carried the\ndesign''s disc — PROPERTIES, DESCRIPTION, FILES — while every block built on\nVcWidget''s `prepend-icon` got a bare orange glyph in sentence case: Product\nvariations, Customers bought together, Feedback, and the non-collapsible\nDescription. Measured against the design at 1512, a block head is a 36px\ndisc in secondary-400 with a 20px glyph, titled 20/36 in caps; ours read\n20/20, no caps, no disc.\n\nThe mark belongs to the widget, not to the page, so it goes in the kit\nbehind `icon-shape` rather than into a wrapper component of the product\npage''s own — otherwise VcWidget would look one way on the PDP and another\nin checkout, which is the split this started as. Off by default: a widget\nthat is a panel rather than a headed block keeps the bare glyph, and cart,\ncheckout, quotes and account are untouched. The four numbers are reachable\nas `--vc-widget-icon-shape-*`, so a theme retunes every marked widget from\none place instead of per call site.\n\nThe title rule reaches the widget''s own head through a direct child. As a\ndescendant selector it also set the configuration block''s per-section\nwidgets in caps at the outer head''s leading — measured 14/36 where they\nbelong at 14/20.\n\nThis also removes product-configuration''s hand-rolled copy of the same\nhead, which was the second place those four numbers lived.","tree":{"sha":"d424fdc7ce448eaf72b50e9c9ac45e4a7b6732a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/d424fdc7ce448eaf72b50e9c9ac45e4a7b6732a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/0b79ecae5dcd771ae4cb63492f77acb987ea46a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/0b79ecae5dcd771ae4cb63492f77acb987ea46a3","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDBiNzllY2FlNWRjZDc3MWFlNGNiNjM0OTJmNzdhY2I5ODdlYTQ2YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/01de74454b47e57b645741a1c6525abaf006b836","sha":"01de74454b47e57b645741a1c6525abaf006b836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-f