/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/a82a228089a50f240deabaee6ded745ba04dd9b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:19:02Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:19:02Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the block heading is 20/36, not 26/32\n\nCorrecting the previous commit. It enlarged this heading to 26/32 on a reading\ntaken while the design''s window was at 1920, and compared it against ours at the\nsame width without noticing that the design carries a ladder here and we do not.\nRead off the design''s own DESCRIPTION at 1512, the heading is 20/36: the size was\nright all along and only the leading was short, 28 against 36.\n\nBoth now measure 20px / 36px / 700 / Inter / uppercase / normal tracking at 1512.\n\nThe design still steps this to 32/38 above 1900. Not followed: the project''s\nscreens scale carries no such breakpoint and a bare pixel one is out.","tree":{"sha":"571cbd4deabeee1d59ddd1975523d6d812207cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/571cbd4deabeee1d59ddd1975523d6d812207cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/a82a228089a50f240deabaee6ded745ba04dd9b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/a82a228089a50f240deabaee6ded745ba04dd9b1","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKGE4MmEyMjgwODlhNTBmMjQwZGVhYmFlZTZkZWQ3NDViYTA0ZGQ5YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c","sha":"62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c"}],"sha":"a82a228089a50f240deabaee6ded745ba04dd9b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/a82a228089a50f240deabaee6ded745ba04dd9b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:59:44Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:59:44Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the PDP''s type sizes onto the design\n\nMeasured against the design at 1920, both pages side by side:\n\n- a block heading was a flat `xl`, 20/28, where the design heads a block at its\n  h2 step — 26/32. It now takes that. The design''s own wide step carries it to\n  32/38 above 1900, which this does not follow: that needs a breakpoint the\n  project''s scale does not carry, and stray pixel breakpoints are out.\n- an option row''s name was 14 in the body face against the design''s 16 in the\n  display one. The face is the page''s own inconsistency as much as the design''s:\n  every other product name in this theme is set in Geologica.\n- the figure beside it was 14 against the design''s 20 — smaller than the name it\n  priced. Now 20/26.7, which matches the design exactly.\n- the Optional badge was inheriting Geologica from the widget title it sits in.\n  A badge is not a heading; the design sets it in the body face.\n\nThe two size changes land in the kit''s `item` view mode, which is the option row\nand nothing else — both of its call sites in the app are that row.\n\nStill open and reported: the widget title scale (xs 14 against 16, sm 16 against\n20, md 18 against 20) is kit-wide and its ladder below 1900 could not be read off\nthe design with the window pinned to this display.","tree":{"sha":"c203407affabf4e547f672a9fae5306383391e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/c203407affabf4e547f672a9fae5306383391e24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDYyNDIxNTgyMTMzNTMzODQ4YTI2NmVlZWMyYTU4YjYxZTIxMWIwMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675","sha":"f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675"}],"sha":"62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/62421582133533848a266eeec2a58b61e211b02c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:51:30Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:51:30Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): every block heading carries the same mark\n\nCONFIGURE THE PARAMETERS had no disc under its icon — a bare glyph in the brand\norange, next to PROPERTIES and DESCRIPTION which both carry one. It was the only\nheading on the page drawn that way, and the design gives all three the same head:\nVcShape plus the uppercase title.\n\nThe mark itself was off too, measured against the design''s own: a 40px hexagon in\nsecondary-500 with an 18px glyph, against the design''s 36px disc in secondary-400\nwith a 20px glyph. Both heads now take the design''s.\n\n`circle.svg` joins the kit''s mask set — VcShape picks its outline by name and had\nonly the hexagon. `--vc-shape-icon-size` is a new public knob: the glyph was a\nflat 50% of the disc, declared on the same element a consumer would have to\ndeclare on, so overriding it was a race with the kit''s own rule rather than an\noverride. It defaults to 50%.","tree":{"sha":"6687c0e1ea502785275ccbf6cc52841c47e525b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/6687c0e1ea502785275ccbf6cc52841c47e525b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKGYwOTAxYTJmNWQ1YTQ5YzAyYmVkNDg2NjQxNDhhY2FiOTE1MzU2NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6","sha":"474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6"}],"sha":"f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/f0901a2f5d5a49c02bed48664148acab91535675"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49168917?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vas11yev1work","id":49168917,"login":"vas11yev1work","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTY4OTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vas11yev1work","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/a9f509b2e582d690831268e26e8a8decd2ef80a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:47:49Z","email":"49168917+vas11yev1work@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anatolii Vasilev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:47:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VCST-6048): demo main page for the paprika theme (#2508)\n\n## Description\n\nA new demo main page for the paprika theme, built section by section\nfrom the Claude Design storefront kit. It replaces the home page at `/`.\n\n**Sections**, in page order: hero, shop by category, popular with\nbuyers, shop by supplier (with stats), why buy from us, what it changes,\nauthorized distributor for, become a customer. Each one is its own\ncomponent under `client-app/pages/demo-home/`.\n\n**Heads-up: the home route.** `matcher.vue` now pins the `internal`\npreviewer to the top priority, so `/` always renders this page.\nBuilder.io or page-builder content configured for the home page is no\nlonger shown.\n\n**Data**\n- *Shop by category* resolves seven hardcoded slugs through `slugInfo`\n(the `categories` query can''t filter by slug), then loads names and\nsubcategories in one `HomeCategories` query. Tile copy, tones and art\nare hardcoded: the demo store has no category images or descriptions.\n- *Popular with buyers* shows 10 products from the iPhone category\nthrough the existing `useProducts` + `ProductCard`. There is no \"top\nsellers\" endpoint to use instead: the recommendation models return\nnothing without a product, and `sort: \"sales-descending\"` is silently\nignored.\n- Everything else is static copy.\n\n**Layout.** Desktop follows the design. Below `lg` the category bento\nstacks (the two large tiles go full width, small tiles drop their chips)\nand the product list turns into a horizontal scroll. On mobile the hero\nand CTA buttons go full width and the gaps tighten.\n\n**Assets.** 22 images, 615 KB in total, taken from the design with the\nC2PA metadata stripped.\n\n**Translations.** `pages.demo_home` is added to all 13 locales. `ja` was\ntranslated by hand and could use a native speaker''s look.\n\n`_paprika.scss` also gains `--plate-bg`, the warm plate fill the\nsections sit on.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6048\n### Artifact URL:\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c756df792bfb6d183ae33f7d936eac18eaa74dd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/c756df792bfb6d183ae33f7d936eac18eaa74dd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/a9f509b2e582d690831268e26e8a8decd2ef80a7","verification":{"payload":"tree c756df792bfb6d183ae33f7d936eac18eaa74dd2\nparent d5cc49aa5ff789e2d724b7dc24b9e7783a484f7c\nauthor Anatolii Vasilev <49168917+vas11yev1work@users.noreply.github.com> 1790246869 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790246869 +0200\n\nfeat(VCST-6048): demo main page for the paprika theme (#2508)\n\n## Description\n\nA new demo main page for the paprika theme, built section by section\nfrom the Claude Design storefront kit. It replaces the home page at `/`.\n\n**Sections**, in page order: hero, shop by category, popular with\nbuyers, shop by supplier (with stats), why buy from us, what it changes,\nauthorized distributor for, become a customer. Each one is its own\ncomponent under `client-app/pages/demo-home/`.\n\n**Heads-up: the home route.** `matcher.vue` now pins the `internal`\npreviewer to the top priority, so `/` always renders this page.\nBuilder.io or page-builder content configured for the home page is no\nlonger shown.\n\n**Data**\n- *Shop by category* resolves seven hardcoded slugs through `slugInfo`\n(the `categories` query can''t filter by slug), then loads names and\nsubcategories in one `HomeCategories` query. Tile copy, tones and art\nare hardcoded: the demo store has no category images or descriptions.\n- *Popular with buyers* shows 10 products from the iPhone category\nthrough the existing `useProducts` + `ProductCard`. There is no \"top\nsellers\" endpoint to use instead: the recommendation models return\nnothing without a product, and `sort: \"sales-descending\"` is silently\nignored.\n- Everything else is static copy.\n\n**Layout.** Desktop follows the design. Below `lg` the category bento\nstacks (the two large tiles go full width, small tiles drop their chips)\nand the product list turns into a horizontal scroll. On mobile the hero\nand CTA buttons go full width and the gaps tighten.\n\n**Assets.** 22 images, 615 KB in total, taken from the design with the\nC2PA metadata stripped.\n\n**Translations.** `pages.demo_home` is added to all 13 locales. `ja` was\ntranslated by hand and could use a native speaker''s look.\n\n`_paprika.scss` also gains `--plate-bg`, the warm plate fill the\nsections sit on.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n## References\n### Jira-link:\nhttps://virtocommerce.atlassian.net/browse/VCST-6048\n### Artifact URL:\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtP/VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxSUQADWs06/RhltSXgFwaVzjJEqu\ncfFCGXXm/FKFHMxXEQJSUjQczQuJ6tAbTOivLwTpVP5LZJeIqWONp/kOw0kfCm+C\n6W8D76Qdp/UGiYpKfQxN9FV7MVrZQfzAGmp7GooaLeJEaZNwYMo95O9Kr8Z+geIN\nmRuG1vDN4TnEwh+WRzNZMYRWAnGZP/fi+h9pW+ecaLRgXqT3t3uB3xASL1tjYSS0\nB/uaB8DlZEO/yJVLfMDz8p6BeUtYP+HDd3n7Uo2/hKQsuap7Pq9ex0Vjb3bqF8R8\n2fpqE8P50iwuowAq81iBEJSOwScIWIdykc+FoXAxwDFWw7no/0//k40yTvByLg56\nLljL5i2ZeTkxzMuNKD/Qnft/hrR/RUlqym1J1ysCesl9IgXErxaVpJLgpe4NqHB9\nHwk4VGOjCdocP2Lm3FzHuMI8+dsWzUx5CsgrLWNsyvuSNm9em1N9pbG+NkGvAZZa\nxZnJQT4Kf6gcn9XZqQxahYGCeGijU63+YzS4dH0A0Jl9jueyS4udI/RaDlYtG7j4\nMU51jF3Ml614StgMeuq0nK9LxyjXhIMThUE/vE30Ep+7ZJ6xq57WpzE3BhCO2emT\nhUmRvgE9hwWC0lj+Nx23EXzc72nK2RVx0n7IaEgQmyfe4ymDDm8WYiZxf+I1qZLM\nBGQ6sftrR8qCo2dVjx7o\n=trR3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:39:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/a9f509b2e582d690831268e26e8a8decd2ef80a7","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKGE5ZjUwOWIyZTU4MmQ2OTA4MzEyNjhlMjZlOGE4ZGVjZDJlZjgwYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/d5cc49aa5ff789e2d724b7dc24b9e7783a484f7c","sha":"d5cc49aa5ff789e2d724b7dc24b9e7783a484f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/d5cc49aa5ff789e2d724b7dc24b9e7783a484f7c"}],"sha":"a9f509b2e582d690831268e26e8a8decd2ef80a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/a9f509b2e582d690831268e26e8a8decd2ef80a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:35:16Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:35:16Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"fix(VCST-6030): the PDP''s radii and icons onto the design\n\nShipment options no longer carries a picture. It was a full-colour illustration,\n48px, the only raster sticker on the page and the one thing in the sidebar that\nbelonged to no palette. The design marks the block the way it marks everything\nelse: a line icon on a tinted tile — truck at 26 in a 48 tile, secondary-500 on\nsecondary-50 — and the group takes the theme''s tile radius instead of Tailwind''s\nbare 4px, a step this design uses nowhere.\n\nRadii, all measured against the design on the running pages:\n- a nested option group was 28, the page''s own plate radius, so an inner block\n  looked loose inside the outer one; the design''s step for a nested widget is 10\n- the Optional badge was a pill, which on a word that short reads as a status\n  dot; the design''s badge corner is 8\n\nThe five page actions were two sets pretending to be one: wishlist and compare\ncame out of the kit at 20px neutral-500, while share, mail and print were drawn\nat 20px in the brand orange. The design draws all five at 16 in neutral-800.\n`--vc-product-actions-button-color` and its hover twin are new public knobs on\nthe kit''s button — the set is warm secondary over a packshot and a quiet neutral\nin a column of page actions, and a page had no way to say which. Both default to\nthe ink the button has always had.","tree":{"sha":"cb34203aa8dc271278d8fbabb3904d6bbbc6b5db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/cb34203aa8dc271278d8fbabb3904d6bbbc6b5db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6","node_id":"C_kwDOU_T1lNoAKDQ3NGIxNTFiODE5M2ZmYzcwN2M4OGZkNWVhYzJhNmZmNjI0NWIwYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commit/e823c92bede3d752aa68bc30408130844fe00832","sha":"e823c92bede3d752aa68bc30408130844fe00832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/e823c92bede3d752aa68bc30408130844fe00832"}],"sha":"474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/474b151b8193ffc707c88fd5eac2a6ff6245b0c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/commits/e823c92bede3d752aa68bc30408130844fe00832/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:15:25Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:15:25Z","email":"mayapavlovna@gmail.com","name":"Maiia Diachkovskaia"},"message":"feat(VCST-6030): an optional configuration group says so with a badge\n\nThe design names an optional group with an outline-accent badge at the end of its\nheader; ours had the word buried in the section description, so required and\noptional did not read from the same place. `section.isRequired` was already on\nhand — this is presentation only.\n\nIt rides in the widget''s title slot rather than the append one: append is where\nthe kit keeps the collapse chevron, and a slot there would have replaced it. The\nheader is now a row — name and subtitle taking the width, badge holding its size.\n\nMeasured against the design''s own badge on the running page: 54x16 against 53x16,\nboth 10px, both `vc-badge--size--xs vc-badge--outline--accent`, same rim and ink.\n\nNew key `shared.catalog.product_details.product_configuration.optional` in all 13\nlocales; parity 1275 across every file.","tree":{"sha":"faca870b522782c3f610226dbea3d475d238e5aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/trees/faca870b522782c3f610226dbea3d475d238e5aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VirtoCommerce/vc-frontend-next/git/commits/e823c92bede3d752aa68bc30408130844fe00832","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16372194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goldenmaya","id":16372194,"login":"goldenmaya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzcyMTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goldenmaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h