om/users/yarith-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yarith-dev","id":270820582,"login":"yarith-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOECRk5g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yarith-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yarith-dev/prism-paw/commits/4a600fee829f52ab7c2996df90599c83eceec7e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:22:29Z","email":"teschhayarith@gmail.com","name":"Chhayarith Tes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:22:29Z","email":"teschhayarith@gmail.com","name":"Chhayarith Tes"},"message":"Performance and mobile controls pass\n\nPerformance:\n- Free each level''s GPU resources on load (shadow map, per-level meshes,\n  materials, textures) instead of leaking ~1 texture per level\n- Upload only painted ground patches instead of the whole canvas\n- Color wave skips finished vertices and avoids sqrt per vertex\n- Two-pass typed-array voxel mesher (identical output, startup ~490ms -> ~185ms)\n- Graphics setting (Auto / Sharp / Fast) with adaptive render resolution\n\nMobile:\n- Stick dead zone and a base that follows the thumb\n- Long-press the weapon button for a weapon picker\n- Thumb-sized buttons and no keyboard hints on touch screens\n- Fullscreen option in the pause menu, rotate tip in portrait\n- Short vibration on hits (Android), wrapped toasts on small screens\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f00e113e0eebb0f7fc996519dc1a1e43620619f5","url":"https://api.gith