kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/c781e89d61fd18f09ceff4097c7b27fcf1b4e442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:24:25Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:24:25Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"feat(game): siparis sistemi ekranda -- masalar, sabir, semaver\n\nSprint 3b/3c: cekirdekte olculup ayarlanan siparis sistemi artik oynanabilir.\n\nEKRAN\n- TableRow + OrderCard: uc masa, her biri tile gorseli + \"1/2\" sayisi +\n  sabir cubugu. Sabir GENISLIKLE kodlanir, renkle degil (WCAG 1.4.1);\n  kalan hamle ayrica YAZILI. Dorduncu kanal: tek cumlelik okuyucu etiketi.\n- Semaver akisi: tile sec -> semaver kur -> masaya dokun. Uc masa da hedef\n  olur, yani \"hangisini kurtarayim\" gercek bir secim.\n- Bitis ekrani kaybetme SEBEBINI soyluyor. Iki kaybetme yolu var (satir\n  doldu / musteriler gitti) ve \"oyun bitti\" demek oyuncuyu ayni hatayi\n  tekrarlamaya birakirdi.\n\nMODEL DEGISIKLIGI: SEVIYE HEDEFI SKOR DEGIL, MUSTERI\n`targetScore` tumden kaldirildi (BASE_TARGET_SCORE, TARGET_SCORE_STEP\ndahil). Gerekce olculmus: eslesme orani 1/3''e civili oldugundan hedef\nskoru yukseltmek seviyeyi zorlastirmiyor, yalnizca UZATIYORDU. Zorluk\nartik sabir sikligindan geliyor. `isLevelComplete`/`progressRatio` artik\nservis edilen musteriyi aliyor; level.test.ts''teki \"her seviye gecilebilir\"\nproperty testi de siparis simulatorune baglandi (30 seviye x 10 tohum).\n\nERISILEBILIRLIK\n- Masa olaylari duyuruluyor ve cumlenin BASINA konuyor: ekran okuyucu\n  bastan okur, once \"masa servis edildi\" duyulmali, puan ayrintisi sonra.\n- Kaybetme sebebi duyuruluyor.\n\nYENI TESTLER\n- Sira testi guclendi: artik ayni hamlede son musteri servis edilirken\n  baska masanin sabri bitebiliyor (Sprint 2''de bu cakisma YAPISAL OLARAK\n  IMKANSIZDI). Mutasyonla dogrulandi: sira ters cevrilince test kiriliyor.\n- OrderCard/TableRow, semaver akisi, masa rotasyonu, kaybetme sebebi.\n\n590 test (onceki 557), lines %99.48, functions %100, doctor 21/21\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ea9201260320b71d008dd015ae85a6c078e720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/60ea9201260320b71d008dd015ae85a6c078e720"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/c781e89d61fd18f09ceff4097c7b27fcf1b4e442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/c781e89d61fd18f09ceff4097c7b27fcf1b4e442","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKGM3ODFlODlkNjFmZDE4ZjA5Y2VmZjQwOTdjN2IyN2ZjZjFiNGU0NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4","sha":"3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4"}],"sha":"c781e89d61fd18f09ceff4097c7b27fcf1b4e442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/c781e89d61fd18f09ceff4097c7b27fcf1b4e442"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:06:09Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:06:09Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"feat(core): semaver -- ajans katmani (olcumle ayarlandi)\n\nSprint 3a''nin durust bulgusu: siparis sistemi baski ve tempo getirdi ama\nAJANS getirmedi. Siparis-farkinda politika ile siparisi umursamayan politika\nayni kazaniyordu, cunku oyuncu hangi ailenin eslesecegine karar\nveremiyordu -- ARZ karar veriyordu (bir uclu ~3*T hamlelik arz ister).\n\nSEMAVER bu zinciri kirar: kit bir sarj karsiliginda tepsideki bir tile\nistenen aileye cevrilir. Donusum YERLESTIRMEDEN ONCE oldugu icin matcher''a\nhic dokunulmadi -- core''un en cok test edilen dosyasi riske girmedi.\n\nOLCUM (300 tohum) semaver kullanmanin kazandirdigini gosteriyor:\n  L1  +1.0pp   L10 +2.3pp   L20 +5.0pp   L30 +1.7pp\n\nSEZGIME AYKIRI IKI SONUC, IKISI DE OLCUMLE DUZELTILDI:\n1. \"Sarji sakla, en degerli anda harca\" politikasi HER SEVIYEDE kaybediyor\n   (L30: %90.3 vs %94.0). Cevrilen tile eninde sonunda ise yariyor ama\n   beklemek musteriyi kaybetme riski tasiyor. Yani BIRIKTIRMEK KAYBETTIRIR.\n   Politikalarin adi da buna gore duzeltildi: smart/wasteful -> patient/prompt.\n2. Sarj 2 musteride bir yenilenirken savurgan kullanim baskin stratejiydi\n   (bedava avantaj, tahsis karari degil). SEMAVER_PER_CUSTOMERS 2 -> 3,\n   SEMAVER_MAX 3 -> 2 ile kaynak gercekten kit yapildi.\n\nHer iki bulgu da order-balance.test.ts''te PINLENDI: denge tersine donerse\ntestler kirilacak, sessizce kaymayacak.\n\n557 test (onceki 536), lines %99.56, functions %100\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8986cbb586bf231ed896a84b77a8e9be62452bca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/8986cbb586bf231ed896a84b77a8e9be62452bca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDNlYmRiOWRmZmYzZmUxZjBjM2UzMjZmODc2MDNhOWEzMTc1NTBhZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3","sha":"5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3"}],"sha":"3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/3ebdb9dfff3fe1f0c3e326f87603a9a317550ad4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:26:58Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:26:58Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"feat(core): siparis + sabir sistemi (Sprint 3a, olcumle ayarlandi)\n\nSprint 2 olculebilir bicimde DUZDU: dusunen oyuncu L1, L10 ve L30''u %100\nkazaniyordu, yani pratikte kaybetme yolu yoktu; seviye 30 seviye 1''den zor\ndegil UZUNDU (21 -> 49 hamle). Kok sebep yapisal: eslesme orani 1/3''e\ncivili, yani zorluk HIZDAN gelemez, KISITTAN gelmek zorunda.\n\nEKLENENLER\n- orders.ts: Order/Customer, siparis uretimi, eslesme->siparis yansitma,\n  sabir (HAMLE sayar, gercek zaman degil -- erisilebilirlik karari)\n- generator: siparis-farkindalikli adalet katmani. Oncelik SATIR > SIPARIS;\n  oyuncu istedigi tip hic gelmedigi icin musteri kaybetmemeli\n- level: customerCount; zorluk musteri sayisindan degil sabir sikligindan\n- playOrderGame + orderAwarePolicy: denge simulasyonu\n\nOLCUMLE ALINAN KARARLAR (300 tohum)\n- TEK MASA CALISMIYOR: oturum 72-104 hamle, hamlelerin yalnizca %11''i\n  siparise dokunuyordu. TABLES=3 -> 22-56 hamle, %15-22\n- SABIR TIP SAYISINI GORMELI: bir birim ~3*T hamlelik ARZ gerektiriyor.\n  Sabit sabirla kazanma orani L1 %79.7 -> L30 %1''e cokuyordu; oyuncu\n  kotulesmedigi icin degil, formul T''yi gormedigi icin.\n  PATIENCE_PER_TYPE=2.4 supurmeyle secildi\n- MUSTERI SAYISI 8 DEGIL 6, MAX_PER_LINE 2 DEGIL 1: nicelik oturumu\n  uzatiyor, zorlastirmiyor (L30''da 8 musteri = 147-185 hamle)\n- TEPSI BUYUTMEK ISE YARAMIYOR: 3->6 denendi, siparis etkilesimi\n  %11.2 -> %10.5 (yani degismedi)\n\nSONUC (300 tohum, dusunen oyuncu)\n  L1  %98.3 / 22 hamle    L20 %89.0 / 43 hamle\n  L10 %93.3 / 32 hamle    L30 %88.7 / 56 hamle\n  dikkatsiz oyuncu: %0-2.3\n\nDURUSTLUK NOTU: siparis farkindaligi HENUZ olculebilir avantaj saglamiyor\n(siparis-farkinda ~ siparis-korunu politika). Yapisal sebep: belirli bir\naileden uclu kurmak ~3*T hamlelik arz istiyor ve oyuncunun bunun uzerinde\netkisi yok. Siparis katmani BASKI ve TEMPO getirdi, AJANS getirmedi --\najans bir sonraki katmanin (ozel tile''lar) isi. Bu sinirlama\norder-balance.test.ts''te acikca PINLENDI.\n\n536 test (onceki 482), lines %99.53, functions %100\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"302d4dfc36ad3a110d6250c95a49d913542a059b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/302d4dfc36ad3a110d6250c95a49d913542a059b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDVlZWRlOTRhNTA1NzUyNTFhYzNkOGE2NjJjZjE3YzM0NmMxNGRmYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1","sha":"932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1"}],"sha":"5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/5eede94a50575251ac3d8a662cf17c346c14dfb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:55:32Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:55:32Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"merge: Sprint 2 -- render + gesture (multi-agent quality gate)","tree":{"sha":"c97bb9fbb6f36b978db946ca3d932864765daef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/c97bb9fbb6f36b978db946ca3d932864765daef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDkzMmFkOTA2OTg5MTc5MzVlMTMzZTZjOTE0NmIwMjM2MDAzZWYxYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d","sha":"38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476","sha":"8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476"}],"sha":"932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/932ad90698917935e133e6c9146b0236003ef1a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:55:10Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:55:10Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"fix(sprint-2): multi-agent kalite kapisi bulgulari\n\nYedi ajanin denetimi sonrasi kritik duzeltmeler.\n\nERISILEBILIRLIK (P0 -- \"ekran okuyucuyla oynanamiyor\")\n- announce.ts: hamle sonuclari artik duyuruluyor (kod tabaninda\n  announceForAccessibility sifir kez geciyordu)\n- SlotRow kapasite ozeti: kaybetme kosulu ekran okuyucuya gorunur\n- glif allowFontScaling=false: buyuk yazi olceginde ShapeMark''i\n  kapatiyor, yani renk korlugu kanalini yok ediyordu\n- ComboBanner pointerEvents=none: satirin ortasindaki ekleme\n  konumlarinin dokunusunu bloklyordu\n- bitis overlay''i mutlak + accessibilityViewIsModal\n- oyun bitince tepsi devre disi (sahte haptik geri bildirimi)\n\nDOGRULUK\n- rowWidth track padding''ini icermiyordu: 21 ekran/slot\n  kombinasyonunun 19''unda satir 1-8pt tasiyordu, test \"sigiyor\" diyordu\n- \"Sonraki seviye\" seviyeyi iki farkli tohumla IKI KEZ kuruyordu\n- INSERT_UI.TOUCH_PADDING turetildi: 32pt -> 48pt\n- mount''ta bayat hamle duyurusu (store singleton + effect sirasi)\n- lastGain: haptik turu artik bayat skor karsilastirmasindan gelmiyor\n- clearCombo: banner''in belgelenen omru gercekten uygulaniyor\n\nPALET\n- renk korlugu testi RENDER EDILMEYEN tabloyu (FAMILY_COLOR) olcuyordu;\n  ekranda gorunen TILE_COLOR varyantlarinda en yakin cift 1.66 idi\n- kisitli optimizasyonla 5.60''a cikarildi (5 renk), test mandal oldu\n\nPERFORMANS\n- Reanimated animasyon config''leri modul seviyesine: commit basina\n  6.6-9.5 ms yeniden kayit cezasi (16.67 ms kare butcesinin yarisi)\n- handleSelect/handleInsert useCallback ile kararli\n\nTEST\n- ShapeMark: tum formlar daireye sabitlendiginde 414 test yesil\n  geciyordu; 9 formun farkli cizim urettigi artik iddia ediliyor\n- durum sirasi (seviye-tamam vs oyun-bitti) gercekten pinlendi\n- \"bir seviye bastan sona\" kaybetmeyi de kabul ediyordu; artik\n  gercekten kazaniliyor ve denetimin yapildigi iddia ediliyor\n- playUntilEnd her hamlede konum 0''a koyuyordu (400/400 kayip)\n- ekran testlerinde tohum sabit: kapsam artik deterministik\n\n482 test (onceki 414), lines %100, branches %99.7, doctor 21/21\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c97bb9fbb6f36b978db946ca3d932864765daef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/c97bb9fbb6f36b978db946ca3d932864765daef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDhmNDExNDFmMjJlMTRjYTE1NTA1MDg3YzEzNGZlYWUyNDZhMDE0NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/821024b2c7948ca0964bdef1043d50e48dd81c04","sha":"821024b2c7948ca0964bdef1043d50e48dd81c04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/821024b2c7948ca0964bdef1043d50e48dd81c04"}],"sha":"8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/8f41141f22e14ca15505087c134feae246a01476"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/821024b2c7948ca0964bdef1043d50e48dd81c04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:31:05Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:31:05Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"feat(engine): slot row + picker + match animations\n\nSprint 2 -- oyun oynanabilir hale geldi. Bir seviye bastan sona\noynanabiliyor, eslesme calisiyor, game over dogru tetikleniyor.\n\nKATMANLAR:\n- game/store/gameStore.ts   Zustand durum makinesi (core''u tuketir)\n- game/data/tileColors.ts   25 tile rengi, renk korlugu olcumlu\n- game/engine/              SlotRow, TilePicker, TilePreview, ShapeMark,\n                            ComboBanner, layout\n- app/game/[level].tsx      Oyun ekrani\n- hooks/useHaptics.ts       Dokunsal geri bildirim\n\nERISILEBILIRLIK -- uc bagimsiz kanal:\n1. RENK: 36 aile ciftinin tamami protanopi/doteranopi/tritanopi altinda\n   dE >= 10 (CIELAB). Ilk palet ton bazliydi ve OLCUM REDDETTI -- lokum\n   ile deniz protanopide dE=0.6''ya dusuyordu, yani pratikte ayni renkti.\n   Aciklik merdivenine gecildi (ton renk korlugunde coker, aciklik korunur).\n   Metrik de degisti: lineer RGB Euclid karanlik ucta sikisiyor ve\n   kahve/nazar/cay''i \"cok yakin\" gosteriyordu; CIELAB''da 20+ dE ile\n   ayriktilar. Yanlis olan palet degil METRIKTI.\n2. FORM: 9 aile <-> 9 form bijeksiyonu, havuzdaki her tile farkli formda.\n   Formlar duz View ile ciziliyor -- metin sembolu (⬢ ★ ☾) kullanilsaydi\n   Android''de eksik glif tofu kutusuna doner ve kanalin TAMAMI kaybolurdu.\n3. AD: Turkce nameTr, ekran okuyucu etiketi.\n\nEtkilesim tap-tap (sec, sonra konuma dokun): suruklemek daha akici\ngorunur ama ekran okuyucu kullanicisi surukleyemez. Ekleme konumlari\nhitSlop ile 48dp dokunma hedefine tamamlaniyor.\n\nYERLESIM -- test bir tasarim hatasi yakaladi:\ncomputeTileSize ayri bir dosyada saf fonksiyon oldugu icin ilk testte\nsatirin HICBIR TELEFONA SIGMADIGI ortaya cikti (320pt ekranda 352pt).\nSebep: ekleme gostergeleri layout genisligi tuketiyordu. Mutlak\nkonumlandirmaya gecildi, MIN_SIZE 28 -> 24. Cihazda gorulene kadar\nfark edilmezdi.\n\nALTYAPI:\n- jest.resolver.js: Reanimated 4 / react-native-worklets Jest''te\n  \"loadUnpackers\" ile patliyordu. Paketin kendi resolver''i dogrudan\n  kullanilamiyor (jest-expo zaten bir resolver kuruyor, Jest tek kabul\n  ediyor) -- ikisi birlestirildi. Gercek Reanimated testte calisiyor.\n- TileShape yeniden tanimlandi: cizilebilir 9 form.\n- useHaptics: platform kontrolu modul sabiti degil FONKSIYON, yoksa\n  test platformu degistiremez ve \"fonksiyon var mi\" demekten oteye\n  gidemezdi (mutasyonla dogrulandi: isSupported kaldirilinca test duser).\n\n414 test, 25 suite. statements %99.62, branches %98.95, functions %100.\ngame/core ve game/engine her dosyada %100. lint 0, typecheck 0,\nexpo-doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c945141595a1dad290c8de76ff53b4384f342587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/c945141595a1dad290c8de76ff53b4384f342587"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/821024b2c7948ca0964bdef1043d50e48dd81c04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com