ps://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:23:35Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:23:35Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"merge: Sprint 1 -- core oyun mantigi (TDD + multi-agent quality gate)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbe8dda26a7a7380ec6beb31af2e9bd12597e673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/bbe8dda26a7a7380ec6beb31af2e9bd12597e673"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDM4MTk5ZGMyOWM0ZDZmNDFlYjdmZjdkNWQwZWZlOThlZjc0NzdkM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/34f110b09d66829a2ec76fe7e8e6eba31194ce37","sha":"34f110b09d66829a2ec76fe7e8e6eba31194ce37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/34f110b09d66829a2ec76fe7e8e6eba31194ce37"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79","sha":"dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79"}],"sha":"38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/38199dc29c4d6f41eb7ff7d5d0efe98ef7477d3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:23:15Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:23:15Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"feat(core)!: sabit slot modelinden EKLEME modeline gec\n\nOyuncu tile''i bos bir slota koymuyor; mevcut tile''larin ARASINA ekliyor,\nsatir saga kayiyor. Kapasite sabit, satir dolunca oyun bitiyor.\n\nNEDEN (olcume dayali):\nSabit slot + her eslesmeden sonra sola sikistirma modelinde tahta bir\nYIGINA donusuyordu. `collapse()` satiri tamamen paketledigi icin dolu\nblogun sagindaki tek slot \"komsusu olan\" slot oluyordu ve dusunen oyuncu\nhamlelerinin %100''unde oraya koyuyordu. Eslesme hep blogun sonunda\nolusuyor, kaldirinca birlesecek bir sey kalmiyordu:\n\n  80.000 hamlede TEK BIR ZINCIR olusmadi.\n\nSonucu: COMBO_MAX/COMBO_STEP tamamen olu, EXTRA_TILE_BONUS olu VE ters\ntesvik (4+ eslesmeyi yalnizca kotu oynayan yapiyordu: dikkatsiz %20.5,\ndusunen %0.00). Spec''in Sprint 2 icin istedigi \"Combo x3!\" banner''i\nyapisal olarak imkansizdi ve \"istedigin slota koy\" vaadi karsiliksizdi.\n\nDEGISIKLIK:\n- matcher: placeTile -> insertTile + insertPositions/tileCount/tilesOf\n  n tile -> n+1 ekleme konumu (her tile''in soluna ve en saga)\n- generator: kurtarma/cift arama ekleme konumlarina gore\n- policies: hamle {tileIndex, position}\n\nOLCULEN SONUC:\n  \"sona ekle\" orani  %100 -> %17.6   (konum secimi artik gercek bir karar)\n  zincir mumkun mu   hayir -> evet   ([A A B B A A] + araya B -> 2 adim,\n                                      7 tile, tahta temizlenir)\nZincir acgozlu oyunda yine nadir: oyuncu ucluyu aninda aldigi icin ayni\ntipten iki grup nadiren birlikte bulunur. Zincir, grubu bilerek BOLEN\noyuncunun odulu -- beceri tavani, olu mekanik degil.\n\nCOMBO_MAX 5 -> 3: 5 ULASILAMAZDI. Zincirin her adimi en az MATCH.LENGTH\ntile kaldirir ve kapasite SLOTS.MAX''tir, yani yapisal ust sinir\nfloor(9/3) = 3. config.test.ts artik bu siniri zorluyor -- \"hedefi\nolmayan tavan\" birakmiyoruz. Ayrica COMBO_STEP''in tam sayi olmasi\ntestle sabitlendi (kesirli deger runPoints''i CALISMA ZAMANINDA\npatlatirdi, testte degil).\n\nDenge korundu (150 tohum x 30 seviye):\n  30/30 seviye p50 olarak 30-90 sn bandinda, gecilemeyen seviye yok\n  kayip: hatasiz %0, %10 hatali %0, %30 hatali %13-14, rastgele %100\n\n289 test, game/core %100, lint 0, typecheck 0, expo-doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbe8dda26a7a7380ec6beb31af2e9bd12597e673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/bbe8dda26a7a7380ec6beb31af2e9bd12597e673"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKGRjYzFjMGEyMzNhYTVjNjMwZWQ5OTMwN2Y3NzBkYjBlOGI4MDliNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42","sha":"343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42"}],"sha":"dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/dcc1c0a233aa5c630ed99307f770db0e8b809b79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:06:50Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:06:50Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"fix(sprint-1): multi-agent quality gate bulgulari\n\n7 ajanin bulgulari uygulandi. En agiri: amiral gemisi garanti testimin\nVAKUM oldugu, mutasyon testiyle kanitlandi.\n\nVAKUM TEST (kritik):\n\"no-stuck-state hicbir tohumda ihlal edilmez\" testi `violations = 0` ile\nbasliyordu; denetim callback''i tamamen silindiginde bile YESIL geciyordu.\nKendi elimle dogruladim. Artik denetimin YAPILDIGINI da iddia ediyor\n(audits / pressureSeen / rescuablePressure sayaclari). Ayni mutasyon\nsimdi testi dusuruyor.\n\nMUTASYON SKORU: 48 mutantin 16''si hayatta kalmisti (%67). Hayatta kalan\nkritik olanlar oldurulду:\n- M33 pickTilePool aile round-robin''i: hicbir assertion yoktu\n- M17 SAFETY esik siniri: <= -> < degisikligi hicbir testi kirmiyordu\n- M30 seviye egrisi: BASE + STEP*(L-1) -> *L kaydirmasi yakalanmiyordu\n- M24 findPairBuildingTileIds: %100 coverage''a dolayli geciyordu, tek\n  dogrudan testi yoktu\n\nERISILEBILIRLIK -- invaryant YANLIS EKSENDEYDI:\n\"Ayni ailedeki tile''lar farkli forma sahiptir\" testi oyunda HIC\ngerceklesmeyen bir senaryoyu koruyordu (pickTilePool ayni aileden iki\ntile secmiyor). Her zaman gerceklesen senaryo korumasizdi: size-9\nhavuzlarin %99.83''unde form cakismasi, %48.8''inde uc tile ayni formda.\nCozum: form tile duzeyinden AILE duzeyine tasindi (9 aile <-> 9 form\nbijeksiyonu) -> her havuzda cakisma matematiksel olarak imkansiz.\nAlternatifler olculdu ve elendi: form-farkindali acgozlu secim ancak\n%83.8''e iniyor, geri izleme 8748 havuzu 15''e dusurup cesitliligi olduruyor.\nAile ici ayrim icin forma dik ikinci kanal eklendi: `pattern`.\n\nDENGE -- olculdu, tahmin edilmedi:\n- PERFECT_SORT_BONUS 50 -> 25 (skorun %69.8''ini tek basina uretiyordu)\n- SAFETY_THRESHOLD 3 -> 5 (%10 hatali oyuncunun lvl30 kaybi %41 -> %2)\n- BASE_TARGET_SCORE 120 -> 190 (yeniden turetildi)\n- RESCUE_THRESHOLD KALDIRILDI: iki bagimsiz olcum davranissal olarak OLU\n  oldugunu gosterdi (300 oyunda esige 561 kez gelindi, rescue kumesi\n  progress kumesine 561/561 esitti)\n- tile weight 5-10 -> TILE_WEIGHT token''lari 3-12 (eski aralik %1.2 etkiyle\n  yalanci ayar dugmesiydi; havuz ici oran 1.8x -> 4.0x)\nSonuc: 30 seviyenin 30''u da p50 olarak 30-90 sn bandinda (onceki 20/30).\n\nICERIK:\nUydurma tur adi (\"Citir simit\") ve totolojiler (\"Cam cay bardagi\" --\nTurk cay bardaginin tamami camdir; \"Susamli simit\") duzeltildi. Gercek\nadlar: Ayvalik bardagi, Kulplu bardak, Acma, Pogaca, Gul lokumu,\nKara kedi, Van kedisi, Sari tekir. Adiyla CELISEN emoji''ler degistirildi\n(levrek icin olta kamisi, cay icin viski bardagi, simit icin peynir).\nZWJ dizisi kaldirildi (eski Android''de bolunuyor).\nId konvansiyonu duzeltildi: vapur/kayik -> deniz-vapur/deniz-kayik.\n\nOLU KOD:\n- level.ts''teki Math.min clamp''i: 30 seviyenin hicbirinde devreye\n  girmiyordu VE gerekcesi matematiksel olarak yanlisti (cift garantisi\n  T<S, uclu garantisi S>2T gerektirir; L30''da T=S=9)\n- generator.ts yorum <-> kod sapmasi duzeltildi\n\nKONVANSIYON: noUncheckedIndexedAccess icin tek kural -- kanitlanabilir\nindiste `!` + yerinde gerekce, ulasilamaz `undefined` dali YOK.\nOnceden generator.ts ilkeyi yaziyor, matcher.ts iki satir sonra\nciğniyordu. Bos-havuz sorunu tipe tasindi (NonEmptyPool): ne olu throw\nne sessiz bozulma.\n\nTEST ALTYAPISI:\n- helpers/ artik coverage''a dahil (property testleri onlara dayaniyor)\n- helpers.test.ts: builders + politikalar + playGame''in kendi testleri\n- SHORT/row() uc dosyadaki kopyasi builders.ts''e cikarildi; sessiz\n  `?? ''vapur''` fallback''i throw''a cevrildi (score.test.ts''te ''D'' yoktu,\n  row(''D'') sessizce vapur uretiyordu)\n- zz-* kesif dosyalari testPathIgnorePatterns + .gitignore ile kapi disi\n- level.test SEEDS 8 -> 25\n- pickTilePool: roundRobin''e YAPISAL ust sinir (guard silinirse sonsuz\n  donguye giriyordu; Jest senkron donguyu kesemez, CI kirmizi olmaz ASILIR)\n\n277 test, game/core her dosyada %100, lint 0, typecheck 0, doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e6bba5e46cae3fb900e10fb181b2b1e5635df46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/8e6bba5e46cae3fb900e10fb181b2b1e5635df46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDM0M2U0YzJmYzZjYTc2MTFmZWRjNmQ2YzJjMTZjY2EzODA0YTFhNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef","sha":"2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef"}],"sha":"343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/343e4c2fc6ca7611fedc6d6c2c16cca3804a1a42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:20:20Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:20:20Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"feat(core): tile generator + matcher + level state with TDD\n\nSprint 1 -- oyunun tum kurallari saf TypeScript olarak, RED->GREEN->REFACTOR\ndisipliniyle. 238 test, game/core her dosyada %100 coverage.\n\nModuller:\n- types.ts     Tile/Slot/SlotRow/LevelConfig/ResolveResult veri modeli\n- tiles.ts     25 tile tipi (9 aile), agirlikli havuz secimi\n- matcher.ts   3-yanyana tespit, kaldirma, sola sikistirma, zincir (cascade)\n- generator.ts tray uretimi + no-stuck-state garantisi\n- score.ts     combo carpani, uzun eslesme bonusu, perfect-sort\n- level.ts     30 seviyelik formul tabanli zorluk egrisi\n\nTahta modeli (testlerle sabitlendi): sabit slotlar + delik. Iki tile\n\"yanyana\" sayilmak icin ardisik indislerde ve IKISI DE dolu olmali;\n[A, null, A, A] eslesme DEGILDIR.\n\nNO-STUCK-STATE -- spec''in \"tuh, mahsur kaldim durumu olusturma\" maddesi.\nIki katmanli, cunku olcum tek katmanin yetmedigini gosterdi:\n 1. Kurtarma esigi (<=2 bos slot): uclu tamamlayabilen tile zorunlu.\n 2. Guvenlik esigi (<=3 bos slot): kurtarma imkansizsa en azindan\n    bitisik cift kurabilen tile zorunlu.\nIkinci katman olmadan bazi tohumlarda oyuncu 7 hamlede, kendi hatasi\nolmadan kaybediyordu (kurtarma ancak tahtada uygun bir kalip varsa\nmumkun; hepsi farkli tiplerse is isten gecmis oluyor).\n\nProperty testleri sozlesmeyi ve dengeyi dogruluyor:\n- 100 tohumda sifir sozlesme ihlali\n- yerlestirmesini dusunen oyuncu hicbir tohumda takilmiyor (adillik)\n- rastgele oynayan oyuncu medyan ~10 hamlede kaybediyor (beceri onemli)\n- 30 seviyenin tamami makul hamle butcesinde gecilebiliyor\n\nDenge ayarlari tahminle degil OLCUMLE secildi (supurme testleri):\nBOARD_BIAS=0.55, RESCUE=2, SAFETY=3, BASE_TARGET=120, STEP=4.\nPuan hizi olculdu: 7slot/5tip ~11 puan/hamle, 9slot/9tip ~4.\n\nSprint 0''da eklenen kalite kurallari isini yapti:\n- complexity<=10 kurali refillTray''i (15) ve test yardimcisini yakaladi\n  -> chooseForcedTileId cikarildi, politikalar ortak yardimciya tasindi\n- core saflik muhafizi constants/ istisnasiyla genisletildi (saf veri,\n  yasaklanirsa \"ciplak sayi yok\" DoD''si colurdu)\n- dosya-basina coverage esigi dogrulandi: 99''a cekilince dosya dosya dusuyor\n\nlint 0 warning, typecheck 0 error, expo-doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3231f91557d8044119baf84fd993e0713744eccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/3231f91557d8044119baf84fd993e0713744eccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKDJjMTE2MmE3YmQ2OGEzZjVjOGQ0MzhiYmZkZDg0NWVlOWNhMTZmZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/34f110b09d66829a2ec76fe7e8e6eba31194ce37","sha":"34f110b09d66829a2ec76fe7e8e6eba31194ce37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/34f110b09d66829a2ec76fe7e8e6eba31194ce37"}],"sha":"2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/2c1162a7bd68a3f5c8d438bbfdd845ee9ca16fef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cel