b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:50:51Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:50:51Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"refactor(web): SPA moduna gec, hidrasyon katmanini kaldir\n\nWeb birincil hedef degil (spec: iOS + Android); \"hizli goz kontrolu\"\nicin tutuluyor. output: \"static\" -> \"single\".\n\nDeneysel olarak dogrulandi: SPA modunda Expo kendi index.html''ini\nuretiyor ve +html.tsx HIC okunmuyor. HTML kabugu artik app.json\nweb.* anahtarlariyla yapilandiriliyor -- web.lang: \"tr\" gercekten\n<html lang=\"tr\"> uretiyor, yani WCAG 3.1.1 duzeltmesi korundu.\n\nSunucu render''i olmadigi icin hidrasyon uyusmazligi sinifi tumden\nortadan kalkti. Silinen olu kod:\n- src/app/+html.tsx (+ testi)\n- src/components/useClientOnlyValue.ts / .web.ts (+ 2 test)\n  headerShown: useClientOnlyValue(false, true) -> true\n\nYan fayda: useSyncExternalStore getSnapshot kararsizligi tuzagi ve\nSprint 3''e planlanan jest-expo cok-platformlu \"projects\" kurulumu\nihtiyaci da beraberinde gitti.\n\napp.json: expo.backgroundColor eklendi (expo-system-ui ile native''de\netkili, splash rengiyle ayni). web.backgroundColor kaldirildi --\nSPA ciktisinda karsiligi yok, olu config.\n\nCoverage (sifir dislama): statements %100, branches %100, lines %100,\nfunctions %96.15. 101 test. expo-doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2ded1a61c8e9aed50495a36f974725dd1282b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/a2ded1a61c8e9aed50495a36f974725dd1282b70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/bfc1299d284f0cd75bf538650cafa500a305d3b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/bfc1299d284f0cd75bf538650cafa500a305d3b8","node_id":"C_kwDOU_wKiNoAKGJmYzEyOTlkMjg0ZjBjZDc1YmY1Mzg2NTBjYWZhNTAwYTMwNWQzYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commit/cac267a766bad342c284a1382d7d361662643236","sha":"cac267a766bad342c284a1382d7d361662643236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/cac267a766bad342c284a1382d7d361662643236"}],"sha":"bfc1299d284f0cd75bf538650cafa500a305d3b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/bfc1299d284f0cd75bf538650cafa500a305d3b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/cac267a766bad342c284a1382d7d361662643236/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:39:45Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:39:45Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"fix(sprint-0): multi-agent quality gate bulgulari\n\n7 kalite ajaninin (code-review, test-coverage, security, performance,\nbuild, ux, refactor) bulgulari uygulandi.\n\nCokme hatasi (3 ajan bagimsiz olarak buldu):\n- useColorScheme null donebiliyordu. RN''in Appearance.d.ts''i\n  `ColorSchemeName` (null YOK) diyor, gercek implementasyon\n  `?ColorSchemeName` donduruyor. Colors[null].text -> TypeError.\n  Izin listesine cevrildi + regresyon testi (eski kodda 3 test KIRMIZI).\n\nGuvenlik:\n- expo-audio plugin varsayilanlari RECORD_AUDIO + mikrofon Info.plist\n  aciklamasi ekliyordu -> match-3 oyununda magaza inceleme sorunu. Kapatildi.\n- .gitignore: .env, *.keystore, google-services.json, credentials.json\n- CI: permissions: contents: read; expo-doctor devDependency olarak sabitlendi\n\nCI/config:\n- ci.yml push tetikleyicisi [main] idi, depo dali \"master\" -> hic\n  calismiyordu. [main, master] yapildi.\n- jest coverage esigi PATH -> GLOB: core esigi artik dosya basina\n  uygulaniyor, agrega degil (buyudukce maskeleme olmasin).\n- moduleNameMapper artik tsconfig''den turetiliyor (tek kaynak).\n\ncore saflik muhafizinda 4 kacak yolu kapatildi (probe ile dogrulandi):\n.tsx uzantisi, zustand->react zinciri, goreli import''lar, require().\nimport/no-restricted-paths eklendi.\n\nErisilebilirlik:\n- Sekme etiketi kontrasti 3.08:1 -> 5.06:1 (light), 4.42 -> 5.26 (dark)\n- WCAG 2.5.3: tabBarAccessibilityLabel gorunen etiketi icermiyordu\n- +html lang=\"en\" -> \"tr\"; ilk boya renkleri paletten\n- Baslıklara accessibilityRole=\"header\"; Screen ile kaydirilabilir duzen\n- \"Oyna\" butonu disabled (yerine getirilmeyen vaat verilmiyordu)\n\nDiger:\n- Sessiz catch''ler console.warn ile izlenebilir yapildi\n- UI olcek token''lari (SPACING/TYPO/RADIUS/OPACITY/ICON) -> magic number yok\n- useSyncExternalStore anlik goruntusu boolean: obje argumaninda\n  sonsuz dongu tuzagi yapisal olarak kapatildi\n- useColorScheme.web.ts silindi (RNW''nin kendisi dogru calisiyor)\n- Themed: bos string override''i artik yutulmuyor\n- test-renderer dogrudan bagimliligi kaldirildi (RNTL zaten cekiyor)\n\nCoverage: dislamalar KALDIRILDI (onceki %100 rakami kod tabaninin\n%26''sini gizliyordu). Gercek olcum: 111 test, statements %98.91,\nbranches %96.96, functions %93.93, lines %100.\nlint 0 warning, typecheck 0 error, expo-doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"817b4dbab37284259d24ebc11e42cd9fe7d29ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/817b4dbab37284259d24ebc11e42cd9fe7d29ff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/cac267a766bad342c284a1382d7d361662643236","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146971439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Celaldnc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Celaldnc","id":146971439,"login":"Celaldnc","node_id":"U_kgDOCMKbLw","org