comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/commits/b768017c85fe183fa96ccb4f98b5b6099035521d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:53:22Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:53:22Z","email":"celaldinc634@gmail.com","name":"Celal Dinc"},"message":"chore: bootstrap Expo + TypeScript + Jest + Husky\n\nSprint 0 iskeleti. Expo SDK 57 (RN 0.86, React 19.2), TS strict,\nkalite kapilari ve CI ayakta.\n\nYapi:\n- src/ duzenine gecis; game/core saf TypeScript olarak ayrildi\n- constants/config.ts: tum ayarlanabilir sayilar tek yerde\n- constants/colors.ts: Turk temali palet (cay/kahve/kiremit + Bogaz mavisi)\n- game/core/rng.ts: tohumlu rastgelelik (Daily mod + test determinizmi)\n- components/Button.tsx: 48pt dokunma hedefi + erisilebilirlik prop''lari\n\nKalite:\n- ESLint flat config; core saflik muhafizi (no-restricted-imports)\n- Coverage esikleri: core %90, global %70 (jest.config.js)\n- Husky pre-commit (lint-staged + typecheck), pre-push (verify)\n- GitHub Actions: npm ci -> lint -> typecheck -> coverage -> expo-doctor\n\nSpec''ten sapmalar (Eylul 2026 gerceklerine gore, gerekce README''de):\n- SDK 54 -> 57; Reanimated 3 -> 4; expo-av kaldirildi -> expo-audio\n- react-native-mmkv -> expo-sqlite/kv-store (MMKV v4 dev build zorunlu\n  kiliyor; kv-store da senkron ve Expo Go''da calisiyor)\n- @testing-library/jest-native kurulmadi (deprecated)\n\nDurum: lint 0 warning, typecheck 0 error, 40 test gecti,\ncore coverage %100, expo-doctor 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"018ed160bf10a6b899d35a31c3e9b1ab3757aef6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/trees/018ed160bf10a6b899d35a31c3e9b1ab3757aef6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Celaldnc/caybahcesi/git/commits/b768017c85fe183fa96ccb4f98b5b6099035521d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"v