ogin":"Kieran27","node_id":"U_kgDOBbdW6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kieran27/hive/commits/f28e7f48aa7666c0fc59fb3f9c13d1b97cd292ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:34:28Z","email":"kieransingh27@gmail.com","name":"Kieran Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:34:28Z","email":"kieransingh27@gmail.com","name":"Kieran Singh"},"message":"Source control panel: stage, unstage, diff, discard and commit per file\n\n- right-hand panel (g) with Staged / Changes for the selected worktree\n- commits only what is staged, through the login shell so hooks work;\n  hook failures open in a scrollable output view\n- git requests are ordered per client and serialised in the daemon\n- background git reads use GIT_OPTIONAL_LOCKS=0 so polling never holds\n  .git/index.lock while you run git yourself\n- protocol v2\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"374ae8464373e6733756d12d9149da8d8dcaae7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kieran27/hive/git/trees/374ae8464373e6733756d12d9149da8d8dcaae7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kieran27/hive/git/commits/f28e7f48aa7666c0fc59fb3f9c13d1b97cd292ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95901417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kieran27/followers","following_url":"https://api.gi