f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:08:47Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:08:47Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Docs: 0.1.0 is on every registry\n\nThe README''s \"Not released yet\" note goes, the .NET README installs with\n`dotnet add package Notato.Maui` instead of a locally packed folder, and\nthe Android README takes the libraries from Maven Central instead of\nmavenLocal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04940ce65bb0efa453e31335f7a6431d94f34070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/04940ce65bb0efa453e31335f7a6431d94f34070"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/06a7596d8b31ee92a9246c986228f596476186f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/06a7596d8b31ee92a9246c986228f596476186f8","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDA2YTc1OTZkOGIzMWVlOTJhOTI0NmM5ODYyMjhmNTk2NDc2MTg2Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc","sha":"a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc"}],"sha":"06a7596d8b31ee92a9246c986228f596476186f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/06a7596d8b31ee92a9246c986228f596476186f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:02:53Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:02:53Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Release: re-runs replace artifacts; the release downloads only its files\n\nThe first release needed re-runs, and two things broke the GitHub\nrelease job: a re-run uploaded a second \"extension\" artifact beside the\nfirst, and downloading every artifact also took the Docker job''s\n.dockerbuild record, which download-artifact cannot extract. Uploads now\noverwrite, and the release job downloads only the binaries and the\nextension.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dafa837630986f851508d77d9f4d2381d3e37e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/dafa837630986f851508d77d9f4d2381d3e37e8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKGEyZjgxNThhNzg1ZGJiMTA1NTgxZjMzNThjMjMzYmU2ZDNkOWQxZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/ef1277803a797fa4e8e36d22b7ca4e69bde24b19","sha":"ef1277803a797fa4e8e36d22b7ca4e69bde24b19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ef1277803a797fa4e8e36d22b7ca4e69bde24b19"}],"sha":"a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/a2f8158a785dbb105581f3358c233be6d3d9d1fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ef1277803a797fa4e8e36d22b7ca4e69bde24b19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:47:56Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:47:56Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"RELEASING: let tags deploy to GitHub Pages\n\nSetting Pages to GitHub Actions makes a github-pages environment that\nonly main may deploy to; a release runs from its tag, so the first one\nwas refused. RELEASING.md now says to add a v* tag rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f024fc383daf88faec5fb5466196c957cb5e9a09","url":"https://api.github.com/r