gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/8759dc799c1dd6eadb2f7a0b308d89acf279bfb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:13:30Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:13:30Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Release: NuGet through Trusted Publishing instead of an API key\n\nThe NuGet job asks nuget.org for a key that lasts an hour with the\nworkflow''s own GitHub identity (NuGet/login, id-token: write), so no\nlong-lived NUGET_API_KEY is stored. It needs a Trusted Publishing policy\non nuget.org for notatorg/notato''s release.yml and the repository\nvariable NUGET_USER (the nuget.org username); RELEASING.md says how.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7bc111ce6925b96cd0bdca9bf2e3cb186ce8ba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/b7bc111ce6925b96cd0bdca9bf2e3cb186ce8ba8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/8759dc799c1dd6eadb2f7a0b308d89acf279bfb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_