…; pft_, pfd_ and pfa_ came from the\nproject''s old name. Project tokens already made with pft_ keep working:\na token is checked by its hash, and the quick prefix check accepts both.\nDevice tokens are reused from .notato/device.json, so those already\nwritten keep theirs. Docs, READMEs and tests use the new prefixes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1a67ae6343e474cb3a3a6e2481651a4672fb3f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/f1a67ae6343e474cb3a3a6e2481651a4672fb3f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/f38f0dd08024146ab93cdaaad8ca3be0d21396f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/f38f0dd08024146ab93cdaaad8ca3be0d21396f3","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKGYzOGYwZGQwODAyNDE0NmFiOTNjZGFhYWQ4Y2EzYmUwZDIxMzk2ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/3206eaa4ca6b6eeb70c01ed6289b0c