g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ed24d92f15a5cc86d286cf568d4ac0f10ce49daf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:02:49Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:02:49Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Server: routes in their own files, a WatchSession for MCP, input fixes\n\nBugs:\n- A bundle could create projects with any id, `..` included, through\n  POST /bundles or notato_import_bundle; project ids are checked on\n  every path that makes one (PROJECT_ID, exported).\n- notato_watch handed revert requests and picks over twice when one\n  session watched A, then B, then A; a WatchSession forgets only what\n  it was asked about.\n- Malformed percent-encoding gave 500 under a tunnel''s authorize hook;\n  it is a 400.\n- /annotations/wait?timeoutMs=abc returned at once; /projects/:id/markdown\n  checks the id; CORS allows PUT, which the API uses; the MCP\n  instructions no longer assume a React app.\n\nStructure:\n- http.ts 1,082 -> 230 lines: the request pipeline and route table;\n  routes in src/routes/ (account, pages, status, projects, annotations,\n  bundles, relay, SSE events).\n- mcp.ts 1,030 -> 729 lines: WatchSession in watch.ts; shared tool\n  results. The derived-column SQL is built from one list.\n- Unused extension hooks (\"later milestones\") removed.\n- Tests: shared helpers replace ten hand-rolled MCP clients (several\n  never closed); serve.test.ts became auth, tokens and mcp-http tests\n  (its deletion slipped into the browser SDK commit); sleeps became\n  polls. 401 -> 404.\n\nAPI: LocalBackend takes an options object after store and blobs.\nHTTP routes and MCP tools are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bed773a7f66551debe990dd09ab33671e81d4163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/bed773a7f66551debe990dd09ab33671e81d4163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/ed24d92f15a5cc86d286cf568d4ac0f10ce49daf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/ed24d92f15a5cc86d286cf568d4ac0f10ce49daf","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKGVkMjRkOTJmMTVhNWNjODZkMjg2Y2Y1NjhkNGFjMGYxMGNlNDlkYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2","sha":"ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2"}],"sha":"ed24d92f15a5cc86d286cf568d4ac0f10ce49daf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ed24d92f15a5cc86d286cf568d4ac0f10ce49daf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:00:44Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:00:44Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Swift: split the overlay views and tests by subject, fix packaging\n\nBugs:\n- Package and share wrote the zip twice when the upload failed and left\n  a copy in tmp; it writes once, uploads, and shares it either way.\n- The package''s file name followed the device''s calendar and clock\n  settings; it uses en_US_POSIX.\n- The sample logged the typed email publicly, and Notato attaches the\n  app''s logs to notes; it no longer logs it.\n- A People-only change not kept, a server-side delete that failed and\n  unreadable server events are logged instead of dropped by try?.\n\nStructure:\n- OverlayViews.swift 1,626 -> ~300 lines: Palette, Glyphs, ToolbarView,\n  and Overlay/Sheets/ (SheetParts, ComposerCard, PinCard, MenuSheet,\n  ClearNotesSheet, SettingsSheet, NotesSheet, Copy); one PinMark.\n- Notato.swift 780 -> ~540 lines: Notato+Server, Notato+Annotate,\n  Model/NoteRecord. ZipWriter, LocalStore, RuntimeState, Selectors and\n  ServerSentEvents in their own files.\n- Tests: one file per subject over shared fixtures, a stub server and\n  a relay network; still 121.\n\nAPI: package(upload:) is packageNotes(upload:), as Android, React Native\nand Flutter call it; Annotation.bundleId is String? through\n@AlwaysPresent (the JSON is unchanged); the server-sent event types are\ninternal. /// docs on every public type and member.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a1932458ae541034436a89f336a6e8e7586e1b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/0a1932458ae541034436a89f336a6e8e7586e1b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKGViYmExMTI1Y2I3ZjVmZmExNzk1OGNlODg2YzhlZjBhZDRkNDdkYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09","sha":"9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09"}],"sha":"ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/ebba1125cb7f5ffa17958ce886c8ef0ad4d47da2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:59:28Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:59:28Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Follow-ups: C# style in CI, consistent phone advice and install lines\n\n- The .NET workflow builds the library with the house code style as\n  errors and builds the sample for Mac Catalyst too.\n- The .NET README no longer says an iPhone needs a shared server (the\n  dev tunnel works, as its own \"On a phone\" says) and names every SDK.\n- The board''s bare React Native line installs the SDK as a normal\n  dependency, like the Expo line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a2f3cd4156ee7b68a0ffd667bbb7ffb89efaf56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/0a2f3cd4156ee7b68a0ffd667bbb7ffb89efaf56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDk1MzM0OTRhOGUyNzUwY2I3YmEyY2JlY2ZiNmRlYmI4MWRkNGNiMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844","sha":"0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844"}],"sha":"9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/9533494a8e2750cb7ba2cbecfb6debb81dd4cb09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:58:38Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:58:38Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Flutter: an exported interface over the runtime, fix three start-up bugs\n\nBugs:\n- Notato could stay off for the whole run when the app rebuilt it while\n  its storage was still opening.\n- A storage factory that throws left an uncaught error and Notato off;\n  it now falls back to memory storage.\n- The route observer kept a popped route''s name, so notes were filed\n  under a screen that was gone; it keeps a route stack now.\n- The minimum Flutter is 3.38.1 / Dart 3.10, which share_plus and\n  path_provider need (it said 3.32).\n\nStructure:\n- controller.dart is the exported API only: NotatoController is an\n  interface (Listenable) of what an app may call; the implementation is\n  NotatoRuntime in runtime.dart, and the note index is note_book.dart.\n- One request helper in the client; dead `persistent` and other unused\n  members removed; docs on every exported member; 16 more lints on.\n- The 782-line test file split by subject over a shared harness; agent\n  relay tests use fake time only. 42 -> 46 tests.\n\nAPI: NotatoController is an interface (no configure/attachHost/dispose\nfor apps); NotatoStorage is an interface without `persistent`;\nNotatoRouteObserver.current is read-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d662d213c840c88dde15121ed11d92bbc909f24b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/d662d213c840c88dde15121ed11d92bbc909f24b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDA3MDZjMmM2OTgyMGIyMmQwOWY5YmIxZTc4MGZhODBiNjBkMDY4NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac","sha":"8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac"}],"sha":"0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/0706c2c69820b22d09f9bb1e780fa80b60d06844"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:57:10Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:57:10Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":".NET MAUI: split the controller, overlay and UI into partials, fix leaks\n\nBugs:\n- The IOptionsMonitor listener was never disposed, so a configuration\n  reload after Dispose() reconfigured a disposed controller.\n- The sample''s Feedback page never unsubscribed from INotato.Changed,\n  so every page it made stayed in memory.\n- StartSync threw on plain net10.0 (Connectivity is not implemented\n  there); it is guarded like StopSync.\n- DescribeConnection threw on a malformed saved server URL.\n- The bundle''s file name and :nth-of-type parsing use the invariant\n  culture; HttpRequestMessages are disposed.\n\nStructure:\n- NotatoController.cs 2,397 -> 447 lines plus partials by job (Windows,\n  Toolbar, Pins, Selection, Notes, Sending, Sync, Merge, Actions,\n  Package); OverlaySession, PinTarget and NoteRecord in their own files.\n- NotatoOverlay and Ui split into partials; Cards.cs into ComposerCard,\n  PinCard and Fields; one IdleTimeout race for both stream readers.\n- Named constants, one Parse<T>, dead client methods removed, XML docs\n  on every public member outside Model/.\n\nAPI: NotatoClient, the server-sent event types and the wire DTOs in\nNotato.Maui.Model are internal (no public member used them); AuthMe is\ngone. INotato, NotatoOptions, UseNotato and Annotation are unchanged.\nTests: RuntimeTests split by subject; still 326.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb3c4ceffe03c41e5161c430aca52dae04a20b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/eb3c4ceffe03c41e5161c430aca52dae04a20b3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDhlYTJjZDNjYWQ4YjM0ODdiYzY2N2NmZjJhNzliNDUzOWFlNzI5YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8","sha":"246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8"}],"sha":"8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/8ea2cd3cad8b3487bc667cff2a79b4539ae729ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:52:42Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:52:42Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Release metadata: author, per-package homepages, no silent missing binaries\n\n- Every npm package gets author \"Notato contributors\" (as NuGet and the\n  POM say) and a homepage at its own README.\n- A release whose platform binary is missing now fails instead of\n  publishing a launcher that installs nothing on that platform.\n- version.ts also stamps the extension''s source manifest.\n- Keywords for @notato/schema and @notato/core; the Android POM\n  descriptions say what the libraries do, in the shape the others use.\n- `enabled` is documented as a <Notato /> and provideNotato option; the\n  site no longer passes it to createController, where it does nothing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"958030db8f4b1461ee648bb2a7a663f6e438282f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/958030db8f4b1461ee648bb2a7a663f6e438282f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDI0NmVlYTcwY2Y3NzE0YWQzZTA0M2M0Nzk4MTM2NzExNzhjZGFhYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc","sha":"3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc"}],"sha":"246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/246eea70cf7714ad3e043c479813671178cdaac8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:52:37Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:52:37Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"React Native: split notes and overlay hooks, fix a stuck send queue\n\nBugs:\n- An unreadable screenshot made every later note wait forever: the\n  failed read looked like an unreachable server. The note now goes\n  without it.\n- A storage provider that throws falls back to memory instead of\n  crashing <Notato>.\n- Saving settings while Notato is off no longer half-starts the sync.\n- Changing captureLogs on a re-render takes effect.\n- The bottom sheet''s drag-to-close used the first render''s close.\n- Accessibility: the connection pill is accessible on iOS; the toast is\n  a polite live region.\n\nStructure:\n- NoteStore (notes.ts) holds the records, id index and pin caches;\n  the transport lives in client.ts.\n- Overlay.tsx 800 -> 576 lines: usePins, useScreenshots, geometry,\n  SheetView.\n- StyleSheet.create for static styles, named constants, one tree walk\n  for both privacy and picking; RN internals only in tree.ts/inspect.ts.\n\nAPI: setEnabled(on) (the remember flag is private); NotatoStorage and\nLocalNote are exported for custom storage; send, flush, authorName and\nscreenshotsWanted are private.\nTests: controller tests split by subject under test/controller/, 79 -> 86.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"effae849e08b2dc6222fd4f054537b927c32c387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/effae849e08b2dc6222fd4f054537b927c32c387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDMwODgyNjQzODRiZDE3ZGMwNjhlNzU3MTcyMmE3NmI1ZjExNzBlZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc","sha":"21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc"}],"sha":"3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/3088264384bd17dc068e7571722a76b5f1170efc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:51:27Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:51:27Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Browser SDKs: split the controller and pin cards, share small helpers\n\nBugs:\n- The picker cleared the page''s own inline cursor on <html> each time\n  annotate mode ended.\n- `enabled` was documented on createController but only the React and\n  Angular wrappers read it; the docs say so now.\n- The relayed annotate request is typed with the intent the server sends.\n- \"Component names\" help named React only; it covers Angular too.\n- The toolbar''s first-placement frame is cancelled on destroy; the\n  extension reads its own version.\n\nStructure:\n- controller.ts 1,211 -> 865 lines: labels, default plugins, server\n  actions, the local copy, page watching and packaging are modules.\n- ui/pins.ts 1,072 -> 529 lines: cards in ui/card.ts; the revert and\n  variants forms share one builder.\n- Shared attributes, text helpers, keys, toast and dismissOnOutside\n  replace copies across files; --pf-accent is --notato-accent.\n- React restarts the toolbar on any prop change except plugins,\n  transport and enabled, compared by value.\n\nAPI: package() returns PackagedZip (no empty zipBase64).\nTests: big files split by subject; real waits replaced by fake timers\nand frames (the extension suite went from 2.9 s to 1 s).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddeac77da403a6a8aabaabcb37f52577f74cdc89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/ddeac77da403a6a8aabaabcb37f52577f74cdc89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDIxZmExNjkyNmNkNmI0OTIxNWExZjJkMDcxZTZlYzdjYjIwYTc0ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7","sha":"81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7"}],"sha":"21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/21fa16926cd6b49215a1f2d071e6ec7cb20a74fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:51:00Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:51:00Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Repo: front page, community files, CI fixes and a docs site for every SDK\n\n- README opens with what Notato does, a picture of the loop, the modes,\n  and a table of every SDK; stale React-only claims removed.\n- CONTRIBUTING, SECURITY (GitHub private reporting) and CODE_OF_CONDUCT\n  (Contributor Covenant 2.1 by reference), issue and PR templates,\n  grouped Dependabot updates for actions, bun and docker.\n- CI: retired macOS runners replaced; the release''s npm job now finds\n  the downloaded binaries (they landed under bin-bun-*, so every\n  platform package would have been skipped); actions pinned to SHAs;\n  the site is built in CI.\n- Site: links to the Angular, React Native and Flutter READMEs stay on\n  the site, anchors resolve per page and match GitHub''s; the docs load\n  a small base.css instead of the home stylesheet; the home page shows\n  Angular, React Native and Flutter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2efcf8fe551e1f35466a5b13e0b67547d4c6155e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/2efcf8fe551e1f35466a5b13e0b67547d4c6155e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDgxZmI1NzU1YzI2OTM1NzVlOGZhM2YwYTcwMjkyMGZhNDc2YzUyYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26","sha":"b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26"}],"sha":"81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/81fb5755c2693575e8fa3f0a702920fa476c52a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:50:07Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:50:07Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"CLI and core: split init and doctor, share options and helpers, fix help text\n\nBugs:\n- export --help omitted variant_chosen; statuses and intents now come\n  from the schema.\n- token <typo> created the data folder before rejecting the command.\n- inject accepted project ids made only of dots, which the server refuses;\n  inject, project and token share one PROJECT_ID pattern.\n- inject --help named the wrong default host; build-release --help\n  omitted --skip-extension.\n- revert crashed on a malformed package.json and looked for the Next.js\n  component where init never writes it.\n- serve now stops cleanly on SIGHUP, like start and dev.\n\nStructure:\n- commands/init.ts (940 lines) is help and parsing; the work is in\n  src/init/ (init, revert, choose-app, plugin, report, transforms).\n- runDoctor is a sequence of named checks with the same messages.\n- Shared options.ts, process.ts, terminal.ts and output.ts replace\n  copies across commands; test helpers and the monorepo fixture shared.\n- build-release.ts is named steps; version.ts also stamps the Android\n  README''s install line.\n- READMEs for @notato/vite, core and schema. The schema is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12dd8356d1d8b2d78e4c2696c19816670cb964f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/12dd8356d1d8b2d78e4c2696c19816670cb964f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKGIyOTg3MDNkYmFkY2QxNTZlNjE4YWQxNTlhOTMwMjk3OTQxZjdkMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690","sha":"60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690"}],"sha":"b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/b298703dbadcd156e618ad159a930297941f7d26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:49:16Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:49:16Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Android: split the controller and sheets, fix state and cancellation bugs\n\nBugs:\n- Notato.state is one long-lived StateFlow; it no longer goes stale for\n  collectors started before start() or across shutdown()/start().\n- Screen capture and three other paths rethrow CancellationException\n  instead of treating it as a failure.\n- recordRequest drops query strings and fragments, as the web SDK does.\n- annotate and packageNotes switch to the main thread themselves.\n- The sample allows plain http only in its debug build.\n\nStructure:\n- Controller.kt 1,482 -> 801 lines: NoteSync (notes, server, SSE,\n  actions), Session (selection, route, pins), DeviceInfo, ShakeDetector.\n- Sheets.kt 932 -> 121 lines: SheetWidgets, ComposerSheet, BottomSheet,\n  SheetBuilder. Support.kt split into LocalStore, RuntimeState, Bundle,\n  LogRecorder. Compose source matching moved to ComposeSource.kt.\n\nAPI: model.Intent is now NoteIntent (it clashed with android.content.Intent);\nserialization and inspector types are internal. KDoc across the public\nsurface. Lint warnings 56 -> 17.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3c272703eb69510572974dc6ef7f6c9ea712623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/d3c272703eb69510572974dc6ef7f6c9ea712623"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690","node_id":"C_kwDOVAp7XtoAKDYwYjA2NThmNzBhYWZjY2U3OGI2NDhhYTJlZWZiZmRhMDE2MWY2OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/b37a753f2854dddcd81af07f7f8f67f5f2fbafa2","sha":"b37a753f2854dddcd81af07f7f8f67f5f2fbafa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/b37a753f2854dddcd81af07f7f8f67f5f2fbafa2"}],"sha":"60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/60b0658f70aafcce78b648aa2eefbfda0161f690"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/commits/b37a753f2854dddcd81af07f7f8f67f5f2fbafa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:48:52Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:48:52Z","email":"domneedham81@gmail.com","name":"Dominic Winters"},"message":"Board: split big components and the stylesheet, share storage and modals\n\n- Grouping appends instead of copying each group per note (a 10k-note\n  group cost ~50M element copies per render); covered by a 20k-note test.\n- api.ts is only the server now; browser storage moved to storage.ts\n  with one table of keys and a useRemembered hook.\n- Detail, Inbox, Project and Settings split into focused components\n  (Screenshots, NoteFacts, Thread, FilterBar, ProjectMenu, sections).\n- One Modal and useEscape replace three hand-rolled dialogs.\n- styles.css is an index over 15 files by area; the built CSS has the\n  same 535 rules.\n- Named constants for timings and sizes; stale comments and the old\n  \"P\" avatar in the webhook preview fixed; unused exports dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"605d3a3ad5eac21ff852a4db94462bb3ada6f563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/trees/605d3a3ad5eac21ff852a4db94462bb3ada6f563"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/notatorg/notato/git/commits/b37a753f2854dddcd81af07f7f8f67f5f2fbafa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34138267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/domneedham","id":34138267,"login":"domneedham","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM4MjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domneedham","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/notatorg/notato/commit/b37a753f2854dddcd81af07f7f8f67f5f2fbafa2","nod