olor\n  ''cancel''            → smooth spring return to home\n\nChatStream:\n- Add onBubbleFeedback prop\n- Depth-0 bubbles are swipeable (pointer capture)\n- Drag right >55px → positive; left < -55px → negative\n- Rubber-band translate + color tint during drag; spring snap-back on release\n\nSingulAIDashboard:\n- Add #gather-zone transparent overlay on particle area\n- 350ms delay before gather starts; particles accumulate every 80ms\n- Drag left/right after gather → releaseGathered; tap without drag → cancel\n- handleBubbleFeedback → mini gatherAt + delayed release at sphere center\n\nCSS:\n- #gather-zone: touch-action:none overlay, z-index 6\n- .gather-ring: fixed pulsing ring grows with fraction (44→108px)\n- .bubble: spring transition for swipe snap-back","tree":{"sha":"414e2a0580082aba70147629655d554e27d28314","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicentedesouzaalves115-ux/stellar-canvas-dynamics/git/trees/414e2a0580082aba70147629655d554e27d28314"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicentedesouzaalves115-ux/stellar-canvas-dynamics/git/commits/bc00f3931b8f241c8c4484e45253914083f04c73","verification":{"payload":"tree 414e2a0580082aba70147629655d554e27d28314\nparent 796ba41f391689a36fea6bb1b2220a147ed255f4\nauthor SingulAI <singulaipen@gmail.com> 1776705840 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776705840 +0000\n\nfeat: Quantum Touch — long-press particle gather + bubble swipe feedback\n\nAvatarEngine:\n- Add gatherAt(sx, sy, fraction): pulls nearest particles to touch point;\n  fraction 0→1 maps to 8→60 particles over 3s hold\n- Add releaseGathered(direction):\n  ''right'' (assertive) → accent burst → absorb to white core\n  ''left''  (error)     → red flash → scatter outward → return to base color\n  ''cancel''            → smooth spring return to home\n\nChatStream:\n- Add onBubbleFeedback prop\n- Depth-0 bubbles are swipeable (pointer capture)\n- Drag right >55px → positive; left < -55px → negative\n- Rubber-band translate + color tint during drag; spring snap-back on release\n\nSingulAIDashboard:\n- Add #gather-zone transparent overlay on particle area\n- 350ms delay before gather starts; particles accumulate every 80ms\n- Drag left/right after gather → releaseGathered; tap without drag → cancel\n- handleBubbleFeedback → mini gatherAt + delayed release at sphere center\n\nCSS:\n- #gather-zone: touch-action:none overlay, z-index 6\n- .gather-ring: fixed pulsing ring grows with fraction (44→108px)\n- .bubble: spring transition for swipe snap-back\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5mExCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABosQABLQX7Bumrli2rZeSd+j56YY\nLQHdAxU6NOIMMwxhnGga3FJGY+Xm8lfW+K+BuvhhGySdEd3YyqGP81dApUUlI/eg\n2669OET0SH//TlOr78K6GH7JzCgGMpYPejdbmxhjiOaZCTXkptr2kq2EBb46nU5j\n75cr+l8tMyLUSa2k72zXwxFV087vtIvc+U9gTsBXdoXrhr+ZggyPAM3pECovfjUe\nDBtiSK41D20EtFNN9P64KDLSwuSiJDAYpTRDWweaEAyNRYC+FlJ/XyOdWc8nhVJQ\ntiN0yK2qu3dsSC+mxfsdSXiHvd/z69cP73soiUQfJuVeqCR+RU6nMnIhdx1di/yF\nUPwVwd1+3Ck0vpEWdAeibGLmfmm1Rfhi1AYTuQMh1/G3wDimYZ4E3RH1lhcpyWy8\njeur8z0YAPsdkjvngeI7YnYcl7PIP7hcpQrArERfmNmGjZ/TiuN152+Gj+D9mKaX\nQuiFxf33rcsDDs2Bf4VQonexQuQNH56pj5xZHtpXHjPLLUzOtLZe2zKwPQCh3vvP\nGcL9lRRGztVy2gNokm+7ubL9las4++S+hNZbfOc8sHpVgZh0Czh0NZaxcnhaISwL\nITGlPRGi6isuG+HGlFlfGLubWHAYQb+9dW/j5gEU6B7twA0IK2FkZGe3QZa0v8DN\n28YAJaPRTv57fO959/fR\n=omJc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:38:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.git