User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/singulAI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/respostainteligentebr2-ctrl/stellar-canvas-dynamics/commits/bc00f3931b8f241c8c4484e45253914083f04c73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T17:24:00Z","email":"singulaipen@gmail.com","name":"SingulAI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T17:24:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Quantum Touch — long-press particle gather + bubble swipe feedback\n\nAvatarEngine:\n- Add gatherAt(sx, sy, fraction): pulls nearest particles to touch point;\n  fraction 0→1 maps to 8→60 particles over 3s hold\n- Add releaseGathered(direction):\n  ''right'' (assertive) → accent burst → absorb to white core\n  ''left''  (error)     → red flash → scatter outward → return to base color\n  ''cancel''            → smooth spring return to home\n\nChatStream:\n- Add onBubbleFeedback prop\n- Depth-0 bubbles are swipeable (pointer capture)\n- Drag right >55px → positive; left < -55px → negative\n- Rubber-band translate + color tint during drag; spring snap-back on release\n\nSingulAIDashboard:\n- Add #gather-zone transparent overlay on particle area\n- 350ms delay before gather starts; particles accumulate every 80ms\n- Drag left/right after gather → releaseGathered; tap without drag → cancel\n- handleBubbleFeedback → mini gatherAt + delayed release at sphere center\n\nCSS:\n- #gather-zone: touch-action:none overlay, z-index 6\n- .gather-ring: fixed pulsing ring grows with fraction (44→108px)\n- .bubble: spring transition for swipe snap-back","tree":{"sha":"414e2a0580082aba70147629655d554e27d28314","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/respostainteligentebr2-ctrl/stellar-canvas-dynamics/git/trees/414e2a0580082aba70147629655d554e27d28314"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/respostainteligentebr2-ctrl/stellar-canvas-dynamics/git/commits/bc00f3931b8f241c8c4484e45253914083f04c73","verification":{"payload":"tree 414e2a0580082ab