ub.com/users/Marcel-B","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcel-B/Microfrontend/commits/6f37b651e6a050c8c6423a3d09af6408809f9de4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:49:58Z","email":"9868657+Marcel-B@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Marcel Benders"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:49:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Grundgerüst: .NET-10-BFF, Vue- und React-Shell mit Module Federation (#1)\n\n* Scaffold microfrontend platform: .NET 10 BFF, Vue and React shells\n\n- BFF (ASP.NET Core, YARP): OIDC login with cookie session, token refresh,\n  /bff/user, CSRF header check, remote configuration per UI variant\n- Vue shell (PrimeVue 4, Tailwind 4) and React shell (shadcn/ui, Tailwind 4)\n  with header, navigation, footer, login, 401/403/404 and debug page\n- Demo remotes for both variants, loaded at runtime via @module-federation/vite\n- Playwright tests running against both variants, CI workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Sth3qthC61gq18MZodSRf\n\n* Enable noUncheckedIndexedAccess in all TypeScript projects\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Sth3qthC61gq18MZodSRf\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a2a68ddfe87af7d57faca393fe1f599184a45d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcel-B/Microfrontend/git/trees/5a2a68ddfe87af7d57faca393fe1f599184a45d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcel-B/Microfrontend/git/commits/6f37b651e6a050c8c6423a3d09af6408809f9de4","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a2a68ddfe87af7d57faca393fe1f599184a45d8\nparent cecc8df7ee8d74726b57fee98725e11eaaeb1839\nauthor Marcel Benders <9868657+Marcel-B@users.noreply.github.com> 1791470998 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791470998 +0200\n\nGrundgerüst: .NET-10-BFF, Vue- und React-Shell mit Module Federation (#1)\n\n* Scaffold microfrontend platform: .NET 10 BFF, Vue and React shells\n\n- BFF (ASP.NET Core, YARP): OIDC login with cookie session, token refresh,\n  /bff/user, CSRF header check, remote configuration per UI variant\n- Vue shell (PrimeVue 4, Tailwind 4) and React shell (shadcn/ui, Tailwind 4)\n  with header, navigation, footer, login, 401/403/404 and debug page\n- Demo remotes for both variants, loaded at runtime via @module-federation/vite\n- Playwright tests running against both variants, CI workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Sth3qthC61gq18MZodSRf\n\n* Enable noUncheckedIndexedAccess in all TypeScript projects\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Sth3qthC61gq18MZodSRf\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx62WCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWY8QAJ6cq3GWS3K4HCSflXMq6jMs\nXFYnZXP0y5sj4DWQp1Odl0fLZSmpCd0CRt0/nlNmgVz9MtIMohgsBTxras/q6SaI\nLrUliuiy5eHUL9BlMZbCnEna8TRo81h/1cq6w8mW4yZb1Huydr4tUVdHbzo5TZ34\n743LUdPdbDePoynK4xAnoJb2B/eUcVT7qL/Gg5m1m3wNcP1UDIPvd/NVcM/6bF0F\n9MFIfZE9aR46CBefqlYBc8PudNYt4YX03T3M1iRr44IFueAIV6uRzEKZL/DnuGdH\nrCtz2esBCb5MOZD4s1+bdhdBePjnJ1NFyGCQhGrhpCMPw7kDP6ZdLLVt2/HcTmFc\nmIFVZsVlVbGcBzAklNfK1EKlT034FgBJ+6wiFPzaq0yCP2v0kAMi7HW4hnNsJLbA\nDgLXxsu4ATHz6HlWjul8t4XyFInACCu9LrlCyeAfrJZktCerRalVkQQWCHh2FCSs\nCaPQGj65iVDMJWOpmyx/eWmo0+UU48dT0Hn2BW1oh+rwy4b1XvM/SAZNJjRWa8KC\n13SLPh4O0T4l92diW5aLreL9wQD3lDQ7Ay8UfZxRVy2QmOUp5u5DpIjlmh2jdl4v\n1TQ8E/6CZjf2+QfkLg4rX+Zi06KvdpL1h3Ot7AVdDwPXTOY1TA5IOa1Wyiu6/drC\nc1mK8k88EqUE4xfMjn4H\n=GO6b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T14:50:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/use