om/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/1625131ceb008c933bc0e5063bc7873696fce381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:50:19Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:50:19Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"fix(tools): skip worktrees through .gitignore, not a path RegExp\n\nTwo reviewers found a simpler cause than the previous commit gave.\nPlaywright skips .gitignore''d files unless the config sets testDir,\nand ours sets it. .gitignore already lists .claude/worktrees/, so\nrespectGitIgnore: true is the whole fix.\n\nThe RegExp also had real faults: RegExp.escape needs Node 24 while\nlabs/README.md says Node 20 is enough, and the pattern never matched\nWindows paths.","tree":{"sha":"7815b56f9db553a671a543766dd7b67932b402d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/7815b56f9db553a671a543766dd7b67932b402d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/1625131ceb008c933bc0e5063b