aximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/0a3b0edb3520867845adba5e8ae7f3f2a72a9da7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:39:33Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:39:33Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"fix(tools): cite the open Safari cookie bug and trim the handoff facts\n\nSecond review pass, two reviewers:\n\n- Safari: the line cited WebKit bug 281149, the wider localhost\n  bug, and read as if a fix only awaited a Safari release. The\n  cookie bug is 232088, still open; 310542@main is one part of the\n  fix. This corrects the previous commit''s \"unconfirmed Safari\n  version\" framing. The note moves to Environment, since no test\n  runs Safari.\n- Playwright: the bullet restated playwright.config.mjs; it now\n  points there.\n- npm: dropped the version number from the prose, and linked\n  esbuild''s docs for the optional-dependency claim.\n- The /sessions/... worktree rule is gone: no such worktree is\n  registered, so it described a state that no longer exists.\n- \"Every branch and tag is local\" repeated \"no remote\".","tree":{"sha":"1a92a51f8517eb06b8cba9ca47c2630a83d7ae75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/1a92a51f8517eb06b8cba9ca47c2630a83d7ae75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/0a3b0edb3520867845adba5e8ae7f3f2a72a9da7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,