912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/d53a5e3d2e1643caa4d1cbf87c4b71ddf8d997fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:39:03Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:40:55Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"chore(release): 2.2.0\n\nA minor release, like 2.1.0. It adds no chapters or labs, but every\nlab and the capstone are now run differently (one VARIANT instead of\ntwo variables and a flag), and there is a new command. The\nchangelog''s version rule now says a minor release also covers changes\nto how the labs are run or tested, which is how 2.1.0 and 2.2.0 were\nnumbered.\n\nThe Unreleased section only covered the capstone fixes, the width\npreview and VARIANT. The 2.2.0 entry adds:\n\n- the removal of the old variables, the flag and the capstone\n  shortcut scripts, which are no longer read\n- the component layout and lab 10''s RemoteBoundary file\n- the trunk-based contributing guide and the unused-code sweep\n- the capstone chapter''s M2 change\n- the browser stats and verified-date fix\n- lab 09''s path fix\n\npackage-lock.json said 2.0.1; it had missed the 2.1.0 bump. Both\nfiles say 2.2.0 now, and CONTRIBUTING says the release commit bumps\nboth.\n\nReviewed by two independent agents. Every finding was a gap or an\nimprecise figure in the changelog, and all are fixed.","tree":{"sha":"ab027ff5f5f