ars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/7ba6c2d968ae2bb67ac335fc6a482a20a4a5f4f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:37:04Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:37:04Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"Merge branch ''refactor/one-variant-switch''\n\nOne VARIANT variable, read in labs/_shared/variant.mjs, replaces\nLAB_VARIANT, CAPSTONE_VARIANT and the --solution flag. A mistyped\nvalue stops the run. One isMain() replaces five hand-rolled checks,\nwhich fixes lab 09 not starting from a path with a space in it.\nVariables and exports that nothing used are removed.\n\nReviewed by two independent agents. The unused exports they found\nbeyond the first sweep (formatPublished, IDLE_MS/ABS_MS), the lab 09\npath bug, lab 13''s hand-built folder list, the argv read in lab 10''s\nstart() default, and the branch history rewriting its own helpers\nwere all fixed; the history was rebuilt into four commits.\n\nRejected:\n- Guarding the old variable names: Max asked for no stale names in\n  the code.\n- Dropping --hosted: it keeps npm run build writing only index.html,\n  which Max asked for.\n- Dropping --no-cart and --without=: they are the only way to set up\n  their scenarios, not a second switch.\n- Keeping lab 13 starter''s IDLE_MS/ABS_MS out of the lint''s way: they\n  are unused on purpose, for the reader''s requirement 6, and say so.\n\nBrowser tests were not run before merging; merged on the maintainer''s\nexplicit instruction.","tree":{"sha":"273d60792ec864ae82e8a82d1d912d611d0a6f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/273d60792ec864ae82e8a82d1d912d611d0a6f4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/7ba6c2d968ae2bb67ac335fc6a482a20a4a5f4f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/7ba6c2d968ae2bb67ac335fc6a482a20a4a5f4f1","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQto