date":"2026-09-23T16:01:33Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"refactor: remove variables and exports nothing uses\n\nESLint''s no-unused-vars (JSX-aware) plus a search for exports that\nno other file imports, and for CSS custom properties no rule reads,\nfound these:\n\n- lab 06 starter/checks.js: lastScrollBefore, and the scroll\n  listener that only fed it. Nothing read it.\n- lab 13 authserver.mjs: isActiveRefresh(), never called.\n- labs/_shared/serve.mjs: readBody(), never called.\n- Exported but used only in their own file, now plain declarations:\n  - capstone: createGateway, createApi, createRecommendations,\n    createAccount, createCatalog, PRODUCTS, SHELL_VERSION\n  - lab 09: DELAY and both formatPublished() (the starter''s\n    never-passed iso parameter goes too)\n  - lab 13: both bff.mjs files'' IDLE_MS and ABS_MS\n- capstone/shell/tokens.css: --acme-ok, defined in both themes and\n  used nowhere.\n\nThe lint''s only remaining hits are the starter''s IDLE_MS and ABS_MS,\nwhich are unused on purpose: they are handed to the reader for\nrequirement 6 of the exercise, and a comment now says so.\n\nTests unchanged: capstone 22/0 and 0/22, labs 09, 10 and 13 as\nbefore.","tree":{"sha":"273d60792ec864ae82e8a82d1d912d611d0a6f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/273d60792ec864ae82e8a82d1d912d611d0a6f4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/bfbe382645bb5ab470b9d85df3c9a43cf59e98d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gra