o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/05fdf65e7697602784295002bd245e6a1be6bae1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:01:32Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:01:32Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"refactor(labs): read lab 10''s --no-cart where the script runs\n\nThe exported start() read process.argv in a parameter default, so\ncalling it from a test depended on the test runner''s command line.\nIt now takes cart = true, and only the direct-run branch turns\n--no-cart into { cart: false }, as the tests already pass it.\nThe flag stays: it sets up the \"remote is down\" scenario, which\nnothing else controls.","tree":{"sha":"9b52c42afacacc443c09dee69517c5d3cbcdd25a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/9b52c42afacacc443c09dee69517c5d3cbcdd25a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/05fdf65e7697602784295002bd245e6a1be6bae1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/05fdf65e7697602784295002bd245e6a1be6bae1","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQtoAKDA1ZmRmNjVlNzY5NzYwMjc4NDI5NTAwMmJkMjQ1ZTZhMWJlNmJhZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41","sha":"5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41"}],"sha":"05fdf65e7697602784295002bd245e6a1be6bae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/05fdf65e7697602784295002bd245e6a1be6bae1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:01:20Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:01:20Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"refactor(labs): pick the copy to run with one VARIANT, read in one place\n\nChoosing between a lab''s starter and its reference took three\nswitches for one decision: LAB_VARIANT for lab tests,\nCAPSTONE_VARIANT for the capstone, and a --solution flag for running\na lab by hand. The two variables always meant the same thing, and\nnothing set them to different values; the one command that set\neither, test:browser:starter, set both to starter. The choice was\nalso worked out by hand in 15 places: `process.env.LAB_VARIANT ??\n''solution''` in ten test files, plus the --solution check in\nserve.mjs''s variant() and four inline copies.\n\nThere is now one VARIANT, read by labs/_shared/variant.mjs:\n\n- readVariant(fallback): VARIANT, or the fallback when unset. That is\n  ''starter'' for a lab run by hand and ''solution'' for tests and the\n  capstone, the same defaults as before. Any other value throws.\n  Before, a typo such as LAB_VARIANT=starer silently tested the\n  reference and showed green.\n- variantRoots(variant, base): the solution-over-starter folder list\n  that labs 01, 06, 11 and 13 each built themselves.\n\nUsage: `node server.mjs` opens your starter, `VARIANT=solution node\nserver.mjs` runs the reference, and `VARIANT=starter npm test`\nchecks your copy. Each lab''s `npm run solution` is now\n`VARIANT=solution npm start`, and the capstone''s undocumented\nstarter and test:starter scripts, which only repeated start and test\nwith the variable set, are gone. The READMEs, the capstone chapter,\nCONTRIBUTING and the changelog use the new form, with command\ncolumns realigned.\n\nNode suites unchanged:\n- capstone: 22/0 on the reference, 0/22 on the starter\n- lab 09: 4/0 and 3/1\n- lab 10: 2/0 and 0/2\n- lab 13: 9/0 and 0/9","tree":{"sha":"6254f9a176913634b0e6624932492522f9b0a303","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/6254f9a176913634b0e6624932492522f9b0a303"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQtoAKDVmYTZmOGQ4YTgzOTczMjgxMTg5NGZkZDI4YjIyODZlMGVhZDdkNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e","sha":"fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e"}],"sha":"5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/5fa6f8d8a839732811894fdd28b2286e0ead7d41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:00:33Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:00:33Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"fix(labs): detect a direct run the same way everywhere, spaces included\n\nFive entry points each decided \"was I started directly, or imported\nby a test?\" with their own check. Lab 09''s check compared\nfile://${argv[1]} with import.meta.url, which never matches when the\npath contains a space (import.meta.url encodes it as %20). In a folder\nsuch as \"Application Support\", `node server.mjs` silently did\nnothing. A review caught it.\n\nisMain() already existed in labs/_shared/serve.mjs, where it did not\nbelong in a static file server. It moves to labs/_shared/isMain.mjs,\nand every entry point uses it: the four labs that imported it, lab\n10''s build, lab 09''s server, lab 13''s start, the capstone''s start\nand scripts/install-labs.mjs. That last one had compared against a\npath relative to the working directory.\n\nChecked: lab 09 and lab 13 start from a folder with a space in its\nname. Node suites unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"1f9298ac96cb801c272d72733c51b4d12e08dd9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/1f9298ac96cb801c272d72733c51b4d12e08dd9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQtoAKGZiNDcwNDkwMmI3NDA2YWVkMGI2OTg4ZmFjNWUxMzM5Njc2OTFmNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/2db8c1c7fd78709b2d5fbb3967171adca9eec37a","sha":"2db8c1c7fd78709b2d5fbb3967171adca9eec37a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/2db8c1c7fd78709b2d5fbb3967171adca9eec37a"}],"sha":"fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/fb4704902b7406aed0b6988fac5e133967691f5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/4e8e3d23448cb780652b0cf141e264e7abfb2ac0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:56:49Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:56:49Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"chore(tools): ignore Claude Code worktrees\n\nBranch work now happens under .claude/worktrees/, and those checkouts\nmust not show up as untracked files in Max''s checkout.","tree":{"sha":"bf223a68fb70b05b045841c201394618621e39be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/bf223a68fb70b05b045841c201394618621e39be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/4e8e3d23448cb780652b0cf14