ser}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/691013edd4c045035ecdc6af54d77e18e6c63747/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:56:49Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:56:49Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"fix(tools): close gaps in the ask rules and allow routine commands\n\nA plain \"git push *\" rule does not match \"git -C . push\", so every\nrisky git command now has a -C form too. Worktree removal and prune,\ngit clean, stash drop and forced branch moves also prompt.\nRepublishing is the one approval step Git cannot catch, so Artifact\nnow always asks.\n\nThe read-only git allows were redundant: Claude Code runs read-only\ncommands without prompting. Commands Claude runs all the time now run\nwithout a prompt: npm install, setup:labs, preview:devices, npm test\nin a lab, VARIANT=starter runs, git add, git commit and git worktree\nadd.","tree":{"sha":"387c3bd0df2d8ff4dd865e071233acea47809082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/387c3bd0df2d8ff4dd865e071233acea47809082"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/691013edd4c045035ecdc6af54d77e18e6c63747","verification":{"payload":null,"reas