 double-printed path, the\nsilent failed launch, the Windows console window, the missing\nchangelog entry and the long subject line were fixed. Rejected:\nrenaming the ''tools'' commit scope (scopes name concerns, not folders,\nand the history already uses it).\n\nREADME conflict resolved by keeping both sides'' lines (mdx/ from the\ncomponent refactor, scripts/ from this branch).\n\nMerged on the maintainer''s explicit approval.","tree":{"sha":"e25d09078826b623bfba6f018695fcceaabda1e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/e25d09078826b623bfba6f018695fcceaabda1e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/2db8c1c7fd78709b2d5fbb3967171adca9eec37a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/2db8c1c7fd78709b2d5fbb3967171adca9eec37a","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQtoAKDJkYjhjMWM3ZmQ3ODcwOWIyZDVmYmIzOTY3MTcxYWRjYTllZWMzN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"http