message":"Merge branch ''refactor/react-components''\n\nAudit of all React code against the naming and no-duplication rules:\none CamelCase file per component family, the page shell split by\nregion, repeated markup and data extracted once, wrapper styles moved\nto CSS, and the browser script no longer recomputes (and contradicts)\nthe build''s stats and verified date.\n\nReviewed by two independent agents; every valid finding fixed in new\ncommits and three commit messages reworded. Rejected: splitting the\nsecond commit (one logical, output-identical change).\n\nMerged on the maintainer''s explicit approval.","tree":{"sha":"5fb09016d4d10608ac4612173a1e5929e53265c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/5fb09016d4d10608ac4612173a1e5929e53265c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/c7c50627cc1489498bab446ea1ad0c18b6c10af4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/c7c50627cc1489498bab446ea1ad0c18b6c10af4","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQtoAKGM3YzUwNjI3Y2MxNDg5NDk4YmFiNDQ2ZWExYWQwYzE4YjZjMTBhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/6c17bc538ef8f8e5335f54522fe4fd82d0503f03","sha":"6c17bc538ef8f8e5335f54522fe4fd82d0503f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/6c17bc538ef8f8e5335f54522fe4fd82d0503f03"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/a2915d277765399c59d0bdccb2ad7c615f43c3b3","sha":"a2915d277765399c59d0bdccb2ad7c615f43c3b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/a2915d277765399c59d0bdccb2ad7c615f43c3b3"}],"sha":"c7c50627cc1489498bab446ea1ad0c18b6c10af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/c7c50627cc1489498bab446ea1ad0c18b6c10af4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/3895fb880f0d97334564fb37dae3aa551ca96daf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:09:57Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:10:06Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"fix(tools): report a failed browser launch once\n\nBoth reviews of this branch found the same rough edges in\nopen-devices.mjs. With no opener installed, the path was printed twice\n(once as the preview line, again as the error). An opener that\nstarted but failed was silent, because the child was detached and\nnever checked. On Windows, cmd could flash a console window.\n\nThe path is printed once. A missing opener and a non-zero exit each\nprint one hint. The child is no longer detached (open, xdg-open and\nstart return as soon as the browser is asked). windowsHide is set.\nThe new command also gets a changelog entry.","tree":{"sha":"5f1355b9e445ca8a29e4d575d4ba3a42eca51575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/5f1355b9e445ca8a29e4d575d4ba3a42eca51575"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/3895fb880f0d97334564fb37dae3aa551ca96daf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{