es to Overview; neither needs data.\n\nIt also stopped exercising the stale-render race fixed in 5984255. A\nnew M6 test holds the orders response back for a second, navigates\naway while it is pending, and checks the late view does not paint.","tree":{"sha":"322d111af6c80eaa1a37c62b16470275879a5105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/322d111af6c80eaa1a37c62b16470275879a5105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/2f6c59fdb50c9160399db9ea8e9fd090bb7736c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/2f6c59fdb50c9160399db9ea8e9fd090bb7736c2","node_id":"C_kwDOVBKlQtoAKDJmNmM1OWZkYjUwYzkxNjAzOTlkYjllYThlOWZkMDkwYmI3NzM2YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commit/e69dcedeb084ebcdf5b2a604b6ad58610df50409","sha":"e69dcedeb084ebcdf5b2a604b6ad58610df50409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/mic