/api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/82ffd155d945debaa32ee12c4767b3d3728595aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:48:28Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:48:38Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"test(capstone): let each milestone''s browser tests pass on their own\n\nThe M1 and M2 browser tests signed in first, and sign-in is M6 work,\nso a reader who had finished M1 still saw them red. That contradicts\nthe chapter''s promise that the tests turn green milestone by milestone.\n\nM1 now checks full page loads between zones in both directions, using\nthe links the M1 acceptance tests already require, and client-side\nrouting plus focus inside the account zone without a session. M2\nchecks in a real browser what the HTTP tests cannot: that both zones\napply the runtime tokens and run the runtime shell.\n\nThe session-dependent checks move to M6: the session surviving a zone\ncrossing (with the orders it unlocks) and the cart badge.","tree":{"sha":"a5704be45df5842ac620fc624bb0913c2794ca01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/a5704be45df5842ac620fc624bb0913c2794ca01"},"url