n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/commits/95f46b8b07dd9f10bb4a2481d7ba16d19c5936cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:43:30Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:43:30Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"test: run browser test files in parallel\n\nEvery lab listens on its own ports, so files never collide; workers was\npinned to 1 only out of caution. Files now spread over up to CPU count\nminus one workers (PW_WORKERS overrides). Tests inside a file still run\nin order, since they share that file''s servers.\n\nRunning two browser projects at once would schedule the same file twice\non the same ports; the config and labs/README say to add --workers=1.","tree":{"sha":"cc789a67a9922a015516c6bb49068e169debf0f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/cc789a67a9922a015516c6bb49068e169debf0f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/95f46b8b07dd9f10bb4a2481d7ba16d19c5936cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com