il.com","name":"maximsan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:35:59Z","email":"maksim.shchytski@gmail.com","name":"maximsan"},"message":"build(labs): install lab dependencies for the machine that runs them\n\nLabs 09 and 10 had node_modules installed on Linux, so the Mac found\n@rspack/binding-linux-arm64-gnu instead of the darwin binding. The\nlockfiles were fine; the installed folder was not.\n\nscripts/install-labs.mjs stamps each install with platform and CPU and\nreinstalls when the stamp is missing or different. test:labs,\ntest:browser and test:browser:starter run it first; setup:labs runs it\nalone.","tree":{"sha":"522c42dd31aee211e217827e7f5d185d053060de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/trees/522c42dd31aee211e217827e7f5d185d053060de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maximsan/microfrontend-learn/git/commits/22157b777e954d1d7ada2cb97b852779a10ca33f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19369912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maximsan","id":19369912,"login":"maximsan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzY5OTEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://